  <para style="h">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ijambo ry’intangamarara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Mu gihugu citwa Uzi habaye umugabo yitwa Yobu. Yari umugororotsi atagira umugayo, yubaha Imana kandi yagendera kure y’ikibi cose. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Yari afise abahungu indwi n’abakobwa batatu. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Yari atunze intama ibihumbi indwi, ingamiya ibihumbi bitatu, impfizi z’inka zirima igihumbi, indogoba zivyara amajana atanu, akagira n’abakozi benshi cane. Yari umutunzi wa mbere mu bantu bo mu buseruko bwa Yorodani.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Abahungu biwe bama bakurakuranwa kugira imisi mikuru i muhira iwabo, bagatumira na bashiki babo batatu, bagasangira. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Ibihe vy’imisi mikuru yabo biheze, Yobu yaca atumako abana biwe ngo abeze. Yarazinduka kare mu gitondo agatangira ikimazi co guturirwa umwe wese muri bo, kuko yibwira ati: “Kumbure abana banje boba bacumuye bagatuka Imana mu mitima yabo.” Ivyo Yobu yama abikora nk’umugenzo wiwe.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Umusi umwe abana b’Imana baja imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na Satani na we azanana na bo. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Satani ati: “Uvuye hehe?” Satani yishura ati: “Mvuye kugendagenda kw’isi nihweza ibihabera.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Satani ati: “Mbe wabonye umusavyi wanje Yobu? Nta muntu n’umwe ameze nka we kw’isi. Ntagira umugayo kandi ni umugororotsi; ni umuntu yubaha Imana akanka ikibi cose.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Satani yishura <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Erega Yobu ntiyubaha Imana ku busa gusa. <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Wamubereye nk’igihome kimukingira impande zose, we n’umuryango wiwe wose. Wahezagiye ibikorwa vy’amaboko yiwe, bituma ibitungwa vyiwe vyuzura mu gihugu cose. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Ariko hamwe woramvura ukuboko kwawe, ukamwaka ivyo afise vyose, nta nkeka yoca akuvuma imbonankubone.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Satani ati: “Ehe nshize ivyo atunze vyose mu maboko yawe, ariko ubuzima bwiwe ntubukozeko n’urutoke.” Nuko Satani ava imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aragenda.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Umusi umwe abahungu n’abakobwa ba Yobu bari mu misi mikuru, barya bongera banywa umuvinyu i muhira ku muhungu mukuru, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />maze haza umuntu abwira Yobu ati: “Inka zariko zirarima n’indogoba zariko zirarisha hafi yazo, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />hanyuma haza Abasabeyani barazitwara zose. Abakozi bose babicishije inkota. Ni jewe jenyene nje kukubwira iyi inkuru narokotse!”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Akiriko aravuga, haza uwundi avuga ati: “Umuriro w’Imana watibutse uvuye mw’ijuru, uturira intama zose n’abungere bazo. Ni jewe jenyene nje kukubwira iyi inkuru narokotse!”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Na we nyene akiriko aravuga, haza uwundi avuga ati: “Abakaludaya baje bari mu mice itatu, batwara ingamiya zawe zose. Abungere bazo bose babicishije inkota. Ni jewe jenyene nje kukubwira iyi inkuru narokotse!”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Na we nyene akiriko aravuga, haza uwundi avuga ati: “Abahungu bawe n’abakobwa bawe bari mu misi mikuru barya bongera banywa umuvinyu mu rugo rw’umuhungu mukuru, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />hanyuma haza umuyaga w’igihuhusi ukomeye cane uturutse mu bugaragwa, unyiganyiza inzu ku mpande zayo zose. Yabaguyeko none bapfuye bose. Ni jewe jenyene nje kukubwira iyi inkuru narokotse!”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Yobu yumvise ivyo vyose aca arahaguruka yitabagurirako impuzu, yimosha umushatsi wose, yubama hasi asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Navuye mu nda ya mama ndi gusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">kandi nzogenda ata co nambaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yatanze kandi ni we yatwaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rihimbazwe.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Muri ivyo vyose, Yobu ntiyigeze acumura ngo yagirize Imana ikibi na kimwe.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Uwundi musi abana b’Imana baje gukoranira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na Satani na we azanana na bo. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Satani ati: “Uvuye hehe?” Satani yishura <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Mvuye kugendagenda kw’isi nihweza ibihabera.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubaza ati: “Wabonye umusavyi wanje Yobu? Nta muntu n’umwe ameze nka we kw’isi. Ntagira umugayo kandi ni umugororotsi; ni umuntu yubaha Imana akanka ikibi cose. Yagumanye ubwizigirwa, naho watumye ndamumarirako ivyiwe vyose ata mvo.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Satani na we arishura ati: “Amagara akabwa ayandi! Umuntu yoheba ivyo afise vyose kugira ngo akize ubuzima bwiwe! <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Ramvura ukuboko, ukore ku mubiri wiwe n’amagufa yiwe, urabe ko atakuvuma icese!”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yishura Satani ati: “Ng’uwo ndamushize mu maboko yawe, ariko ntihagire ico ugira ubuzima bwiwe.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Nuko Satani ava imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aragenda, ateza Yobu ibihute bibabaza cane kuva mu bworo bw’ikirenge gushitsa ku mutwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Maze Yobu afata urujo aba ari rwo yama yiyagarisha, yicaye mu munyota.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Umugore wiwe amubwira ati: “Mbega uracumiye ku bwizigirwa bwawe? Pfuma utuka Imana upfe!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Aramwishura ati: “Uvuze nk’umugore w’igipfu. Mbega mu biva ku Mana twokwakira ivyiza gusa, ibibi ntituvyakire?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Muri ivyo vyose, Yobu ntiyigeze acumura mu majambo yavuze.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Abagenzi batatu ba Yobu ari bo Elifazi w’i Temani, Biludadi w’i Shuhi, na Zofari w’i Nayama, bumvise ivyago vyamushikiye, bava i muhira iwabo, bafatana urugendo, baja kumugarukirako no kumuremesha. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Bamubonye bakiri kure, basanga ntakimenyekana, baraboroga, baraturikisha bararira. Bitaburirako impuzu, biyorera umukungugu ku mutwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Baca bicarana na we hasi, bamara imisi indwi n’amajoro indwi. Nta n’umwe yigeze amuvugisha, kuko bari babonye ingene ari mu mubabaro mwinshi.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu yicuza kuba yaravutse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yobu yugurura akanwa aravuga, avuma umusi yavukiyeko. <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Umusi navukiyeko urakazimangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">n’ijoro havuzwe ngo: ‘Umwana w’umuhungu yasamwe inda.’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Uwo musi uragahinduka umwijima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Imana ntakawibuke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">kandi ntukarasirwe n’umuco.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Urakizizirwa n’umwijima w’umuzitanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">igicu cirabura kiwutere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">n’ubwirakabiri buwutwikire.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Iryo joro riragacakirwa n’umwijima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ntiriharurwe mu misi igize umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">canke ngo rishirwe mu misi igize ukwezi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Iryo joro rirakaba ingumba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ntihagire impundu zumvikana muri ryo.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Abahinga bo kuvuma nibarivume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">bamwe bashobora gukangura Leviyatani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamwe bibaza ko yari ingona canke igisato co mu mazi.</char></note>.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Igitondo cawo kiragahinduka umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">kirindire umuco kitari buronke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ntikibone n’imishwarara ya mbere yo mu gitondo,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />kuko kitanyugaraniye mu nda yanyibungenze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">kugira ngo kimpishe amakuba ndiko ndabona.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Ni kuki ntapfumye mpfa nkivuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ngacikana nkiva mu nda?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Ni kuki mama yandetse nkabaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">akampa ibere ryiwe nkaryonka?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Iyo andeka nkipfira, ubu mba niruhukiye mu mahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">mba nisinziririye, ntekanye.<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />Mba nduhukanye n’abami n’abatware b’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">abari bariyubakiye amazu akomeye, ariko ubu ari imisaka.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Mba nduhukanye n’abatware bari bafise inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">bari barujuje amazu yabo amafeza.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Canke mbega ni kuki ntahambwe nk’inda ikorotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">nkamera nk’umwana atabayeho ngo abone umuco?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Mu mva abanyakibi bararuhuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">abananiwe bakaronka uburuhukiro.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Imbohe zinezerezwa no kworoherwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">ntizisubira kwumva urwamo rw’abashoreye abagurano,<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Abahambaye n’aboroshe ni yo bari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">kandi abagurano ntibakiganzwa na ba shebuja.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Ni kuki umuco urasira abari mu marushwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">abafise imitima ituntuye bagahabwa ubuzima?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Bararondera urupfu ntibaruronka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">naho borurondera nk’abarondera ubutunzi buhishije.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Baranezerwa cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">bagahimbarwa iyo bashitse mu mva.<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Ni kuki ubuzima buhabwa umuntu atabona n’iyo aja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">uwo Imana yugarije n’imibabaro?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Ukubiha ni yo ndya yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">kuboroga ni yo mazi nywa.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Ivyo natinya ni vyo bimbayeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ivyantera ubwoba ni vyo binshikiye.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Nta mahoro ngira, sintekaniwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">Singira akaruhuko, ahubwo ndi mu makuba.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elifazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Maze Elifazi w’i Temani aca avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Mbega uwokwubahuka akagira ico avuze, wokwihangana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Ariko kandi ni nde yoshobora guhora ntavuge?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Ibuka ingene wigishije benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">n’ingene wateye intege abadendebukiwe.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Amajambo yawe yashigikira abariko baratemba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">agakomeza abafise amavi areganutse.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Ariko ubu ivyago biraguteye, none urihebuye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">bigushitseko, none ucitse ivutu.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Mbega kwubaha Imana kwawe, ntigukwiye kukuremesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">kuba inyankamugayo ntigukwiye kugutera ivyizigiro?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Gerageza wibuke: hari intungane yazimanganijwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">canke umugororotsi yaranduwe?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Jewe naritegereje, nsanga abarima ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">n’ababiba amagorwa ari vyo bimbura.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Imana ibahushe baca bazimangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">bakamarwa n’igihuhusi c’uburake bwayo.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Intare zirashobora kuroha no kwivuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ariko, Imana ivunagura amenyo y’izikomeye kurusha izindi.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Intare irapfa kubera yabuze ico irya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ibibuguru vyayo vyose bigashwiragira.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Hari ijambo ryanshikiriye mw’ibanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ugutwi kwanje kuryumva nko mu vyongoshwe.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Ryaje kurya kw’indoto zihagarika umutima w’umuntu mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">igihe itiro riremera abantu,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />maze mfatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi no guhinda agashitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">amagufa yanje arajugumira.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Impwemu yaciye imbere yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">maze umubiri wanje uramerereza.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Hanyuma irahagarara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ariko sinashobora kubona uko imeze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Haje ishusho ihagarara imbere y’amaso yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">maze numva ijwi ryongorera, riti:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‘Mbega umuntu apfa yogororoka gusumvya Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Umuntu buntu yotungana kurusha Umuremyi wiwe?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Nimba Imana itizigira abakozi bayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">igatora amakosa abamarayika bayo,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />mbega ntibirushirije ku bantu baba mu nzu z’ibumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">urufatiro bubatseko rukaba ari umukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">bagafyonyorwa vyoroshe gusumba inzu y’umuswa!<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Mu gitondo baba ari bazima, ku mugoroba bakaba bavunaguwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">bakagenda akagirire, ntihagire n’uwuvyitaho.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Imigozi y’ihema ryabo irakwezwe, na ryo riratemvye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">None ntibapfuye nk’imburabwenge?’<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Nimba ushaka, tabaza, ariko ni nde azokwitaba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Uwo mu bera wokwikorako ni nde?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Igipfu cicwa n’inzigo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">imburabwenge ikicwa n’ishari.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Jewe ubwanje narabonye igipfu gishinga imizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">ariko ubwo nyene inzu yaco ica iravumwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Abana baco babura uwubitaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">batsindwa n’urubanza kuko ata wubaburanira.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Abashonje barya ivyimburwa vyaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">mbere bakabikura no hagati mu mahwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">abanyotewe na bo bimarira inyota ku butunzi bwaco.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Imibabaro ntimera iva mw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">kandi ingorane ntizimera ziva mw’ivu.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Ariko umuntu aba akivuka ingorane zikaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">kurya kw’amasase ataruka.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Ariko iyo mba wewe, mba nituye Imana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">urubanza rwanje akaba ari yo ndaruha.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Ni yo ikora utwumiza tudatahurika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">n’ibimenyetso bitoshobora guharurwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Ni yo igwisha imvura kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">ikarungika amazi yo kuvomera imirima.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Ni yo ishira hejuru ba nyarucari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">abari mu kigandaro ikabatabara.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Yica integuro z’abakoresha urwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">amaboko yabo akabura ico ashikako.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Ifatira abigira abanyabwenge mu bugunge bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">kandi inama zabo ikazisambura.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Umwijima ubahwikira ku murango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">mu mashoka bakazimagirika nko mw’ijoro.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Ikiza abakene inkota yo mu kanwa kabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ikabakura mu vyara vy’abanyenkomezi.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Abakene baraheza bakagira ivyizigiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">akarenganyo kakazibwa akanwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Hahiriwe uwukosorwa n’Imana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">None rero ntukengere gutozwa indero n’Iyishoboravyose.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Ni yo ikomeretsa, ariko ni na yo isomora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ni yo ikubita, ariko ukuboko kwayo ni kwo gukiza.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Ni yo izogukiza ibiza bitandatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">kandi ivyago indwi ntakizogushikako.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Mu gihe c’amapfa izogukiza urupfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">mu ntambara izogukiza inkota.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Izogukingira akarimi k’abakuvuga nabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">kandi ntuzotinya agatikizo nikashika.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Uzotwenga agatikizo n’amapfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">kandi ntuzotinya ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Uzobana impore n’amabuye yo mu mirima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba muzobana amahoro.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Uzoraba ingene ugira amahoro mu nzu yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">kandi niwasuzuma ubutunzi bwawe uzosanga ata gihaze.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Uzibonera ingene abana bawe baba benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">kandi uruvyaro rwawe ruzomera nk’ivyatsi vyo kw’isi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Uzoshika mu mva wisaziye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">nk’umukama w’ingano wimbuwe hageze.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Ivyo twaravyihweje dusanga ni ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">None nawe nuvyumve bigire ico bikwigishije.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Yobu yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Iyaba umubabaro wanje washobora kugerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">amarushwa yanje agashirwa ku munzane!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Ni ukuri vyoremera kuruta umusenyi wo ku kiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">Ni co catumye nsuka amajambo ntiyumviriye.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Imyampi y’Iyishoboravyose irantobekeranije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">umutima wanje uriko unywa ubumara bwayo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">Ibiteye ubwoba biva ku Mana biransagirije.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Mbega indogoba y’inyeshamba irabira ifise ubwatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">canke impfizi yokwabira ifise ivyo irya?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Mbega indya zitagira akanovera zoribwa zitagira umunyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">canke hari uburyohe buri mu murenda w’irigi?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Ivyokurya nk’ivyo singomba no kubikorako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">bintera iseseme.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Ese icompa nkishurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">Imana ikampa ico ndayitezeko,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Ikemera kumfyonyora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ikaramvura ukuboko kwayo ikanzimanganya.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Ivyo vyondemesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">no mu mibabaro ngasimbishwa n’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">kuko ntigeze ntirimuka ku majambo y’Uwera.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Mbega inkomezi mfise ni izihe, zotuma nkomeza kugira ivyizigiro?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Ni igiki cotuma nkomeza kwihangana?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Mbega mfise inkomezi nk’iz’ibuye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Canke umubiri wanje ukozwe mu mwakaka?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Mbega ubu hari ubushobozi ngifise bwo kwifasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">kandi ata kintu ngikora ngo gikunde?<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Umuntu wese atagirira ubugwaneza mugenziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">aba yerekanye ukutubaha Iyishoboravyose.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Abagenzi banje barampemukiye, bambera nk’imigezi itamana amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">nk’imigezi yuzura amazi mu gihe c’imvura gusa,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />iyo irengewe n’ugukama kw’urubura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">hamwe n’ugushonga kwa shelegi.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Ntiheza ngo isubire gutemba, igihe c’ici kije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">yumvise ubushuhe imigende yayo ica ikamangana.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Umugwi munini w’abari ku rugendo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">bakikevya ngo bizimye inyota, ariko bakabura amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">maze bakaduga mu bugaragwa, bakagwayo.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Umugwi munini w’ab’i Tema bari ku rugendo barondeye amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">n’ingenzi z’abadandaza b’i Sheba baronderanye ivyizigiro,<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />ariko bicuza igituma bizigiye iyo migende,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">kuko bahashitse ivyizigiro bigahera.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />None namwe mugaragaye ko ata co muri bumarire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">mwabonye amarushwa ndimwo muhinda agashitsi.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Mbega ni kubera iki? Hari ico nabasavye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">Nigeze ndabasaba ngo muntangire impongano mu butunzi bwanyu?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Nigeze ndabasaba ngo munkize ukuboko kw’umwansi wanje?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">Canke ngo munkure mu maboko y’abampahaza?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Nimunyigishe nanje ndacereza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">nimunyereke aho nihenze.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Amajambo y’ukuri burya arababaza!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Ariko ibihari vyanyu bishika ku ki?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Mbega mushaka kumpinyuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">mu guhindura ubusa amarira y’ukwihebura kwanje?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Erega mweho mbona n’impfuvyi mwoyipfindanirako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">umukunzi wanyu mukamugurisha!<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Ariko noneho nimungirire impuhwe, munyitegereze!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Noba nabesheye mu maso yanyu?<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Nimwiyumvire neza, mureke kunyagiriza ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">kuko ndi umugororotsi.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Mbega hari amajambo y’ukugabitanya mwanyumvanye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Mbega akanwa kanje kananiwe no gutandukanya ikibi n’iciza?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Mbega uwuri kw’isi wese ntaba akiri mu ntambara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Imisi yiwe ntimeze nk’iy’umucangero?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Nk’uko umugurano yipfuza igitutu ku zuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">canke umushumba arindirana igishika agahembo kiwe,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Ni ko nanje nahawe amezi y’amagorwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">nongera nshirirwaho amajoro y’umuruho.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Iyo ndyamye nibaza nti: ‘Mbega buca ryari?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Ijoro ririkwega, nanje nkagaragurika bukarinda buca.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Umubiri wanje utwikiriwe n’inyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">urukoba rwanje ruriko ibisebe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">hanyuma rugaturika amashira.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Imisi yanje yihuta kurusha ikijishisho c’impuzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ariko irangiye ntafise ivyizigiro.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Ndakwinginze, ewe Mana, wibuke ko ubuzima bwanje bumeze nk’impwemu zihumetswe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">kandi amaso yanje ntazosubira kubona umunezero.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Amaso ambona uno musi ntazosubira kumbona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">uzondondera, ariko sinzoba nkiriho.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Nk’uko igicu gisanzara kikazimangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">ni ko uwuja i kuzimu mu mva adasubira kugaruka.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Ntazogaruka i muhira iwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">inzu yiwe ntizosubira kumumenya.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Ni co gituma ntashobora guhora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ntegerezwa kuvuga kubera umubabaro wo mu mutima wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">nzokwidodomba kubera umururazi uri mu mushaha wanje.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Mbega mbaye ikiyaga, canke igisizimwe co mw’ibenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">aho uncungisha umuragizi?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Iyo ngiye kuryama nibwira ko uburiri bunyirura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">canke ko umusego ungabanya imibabaro,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />na ho nyene uncisha ivutu ivyo ndota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">ukandanduza umutima ivyo nerekwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Ni co gituma numva nopfuma mpfa nizwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">hako nguma mu mubiri wanje meze gutya.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Numva nanse ubuzima bwanje, sinkeneye kubandanya mbaho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Nundeke kuko imisi yo kubaho kwanje nta co imaze.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Mbega umuntu ni iki aho umwitaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">aho umwitwararika cane?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Ukamusuzuma uko bukeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">ukamugeza akanya kose?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Mbega uzoreka kunshinga ijisho ryari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">ngo untezurire na gatoya mire amate?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Yewe murinzi w’abantu, nimba naragucumuyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">nakoze icaha nyabaki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Ni kuki ari jewe uhiga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Mbega nakuremereye?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Ni kuki utamparira ibigabitanyo vyanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ngo ubabarire ibicumuro vyanje?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Kuko buca nja mu mukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">kandi uzondondera, ariko ntuzoba ukimbona.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Biludadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Maze Biludadi Umunyeshuhi yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Mbega uzogeza ryari kuvuga ibintu nk’ivyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Amajambo yawe ameze nk’igihuhuta c’umuyaga.<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Mbega Imana iraca urwa ngondagonde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Iyishoboravyose irahotora umugororotsi?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Abana bawe barayicumuyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">yabahaye igihano gihwanye n’ivyo bakoze.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Ariko wewe woronderana Imana umwete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">ukinginga Iyishoboravyose,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />ukayitunganira, ukayigororokera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">naho bimeze uku yohaguruka ikaza kugutabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">ikagusubiza mu vyiza wahozemwo.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Naho intango yawe yari nto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">imisi y’iherezo ryawe izoba myiza cane.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Baza urunganwe rwo hambere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">ushire umutima ku vyo ba sogokuruza baciyemwo.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Kuko twebwe twari abana b’ejo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">kandi imisi tumara hano kw’isi imeze nk’igitutu.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />None ntibazokwigisha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Ugira ngo ntibazokubwira ijambo bakuye mu gutahura kwabo?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Mbega urufunzo rwokura rutari ahantu hajaga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Canke irenga ryokura ritari mu mazi?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Bikiriko birakura, ata n’uwubitemye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">vyotanga ibindi vyatsi vyose kwuma.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Uko ni ko abantu bose baretse Imana bamera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ivyizigiro vy’abatubaha Imana birakamangana.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Ivyo bizigira vyose birashira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ivyo bishimikiza bimeze nk’inzu y’igitangurirwa.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Begamira inzu zabo, ariko ntizigumye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">bazishirako umutima cane, ariko ntizihagarara.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Bameze nk’igiterwa kivomerewe neza kikaronka n’izuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">gikwiza amashami yaco mw’itongo.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Gisobeka imizi yaco hagati mu bitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">kikironkera ikibanza hagati mu mabuye.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Ariko iyo kiranduwe aho cameze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">aho hantu haracihakana hakavuga hati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">‘Sinigeze ndakumenya.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Ubuzima bwaco buba buhereye aho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">maze ibindi bigaheza bikamera aho cahora.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Erega Imana ntiheba umuntu atayicumuyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">canke ngo ikomeze amaboko y’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Akanwa kawe izokuzuza ibitwengatwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">iminwa yawe na yo iyuzuze impundu.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Abansi bawe bazoteterwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">kandi inzu z’abanyakibi ntizizoba zikiriho.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Maze Yobu asubizayo ati:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Ni ukuri ndazi ko ari uko biri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Nta muntu buntu yogororoka mu nyonga z’Imana.<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />N’uwogomba kuyiburanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">mu bibazo igihumbi ntiyoshobora kuyishura na kimwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Ifise ubwenge bwinshi kandi ni Inyenkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Ni nde yayigararije akayiva imbere amahoro?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Yimura imisozi itayigishije inama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">mu burake bwayo ikayubika.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Itigitishiriza isi mu kibanza cayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">inkingi zayo zikanyiganyiga.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Itegetse, izuba ntiriseruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">n’inyenyeri ntizaka.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Ni yo yonyene yagaranzuye amajuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">ikagendagendera ku mipfunda y’ikiyaga.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Ni yo yaremye imigwi y’inyenyeri yitwa Dubu, Oriyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">Kilimiya n’imigwi y’izo mu bumanuko.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Ikora ibitangaza ata wobitahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">n’ibimenyetso bitoharurika.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Inciye i ruhande sindayibona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">indenganye sindayumva.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Mbega inyakuye uwo ishaka ni nde yoyitangira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Ni nde yonayibaza ati: ‘Ivyo ugize ni ibiki?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Imana ntihagarika uburake bwayo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">Mbere n’ibiyoberane bikomeye vyo mu kiyaga birunama ku birenge vyayo.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Mbega jewe noyihaririza nte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Amajambo yo kuyiburanya noyakura he?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Naho ata co nzira, simfise ico noyisubiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ico nshobora gukora ni ugusaba imbabazi gusa.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Naho noyitwarira ikitaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">sinzi ko yonantega ugutwi.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Kuko n’ubu irantera ikamvunaguza ibihuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ikanyuzuzako ibikomere ata nyanduruko.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Ntizondeka ngo mire amate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ahubwo inyuzuza amarushwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Tuvuze ivy’inkomezi, ni yo ishobora vyose!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Mu vy’ubutungane, ni nde yoyirengutsa?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Naho noba nera, akanwa kanje ni ko kontsindisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">naho noba ngororotse, koncira urubanza ko ntsinzwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Naho ngororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">sincibabaye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">Ngaye ubuzima bwanje.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Ngororoka, ntagororoka, vyose ni co kimwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">Ni co gituma mvuga nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">‘Irandurana umugororotsi n’umunyakibi.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Iyo icago gihwikiye abagororotsi kikabica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">Imana irabaraba mu magorwa yabo ikitwengera.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Isi yose iri mu biganza vy’abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Imana na yo igahuma amaso y’abacamanza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Nimba atari yo ibigira none ni nde?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Imisi yo kubaho kwanje yiruka gusumvya uwusiganwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">iguruka ata n’amahirwe na makeya.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Yirasa nk’ubwato bukozwe mu rufunzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">nk’inkona yirasa igomba ico ifata.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Hamwe nofata ingingo nti: ‘Hinge niyibagize imyidodombo yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">mve mu mibabaro yanje, nce mu maso, mwenyure,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />na ho nyene nogumana ubwoba bw’imibabaro yanje yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">kuko nzi ko utazoncira urunyeza.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />None ko niteze gutsindwa n’urubanza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">ndiko ndansha nokora iki?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Naho nokwiyogesha isabune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">iminwe yanje nkayikarabisha iyeza cane,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />womvumbagaza mu kinogo c’ivyondo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">gushika aho n’impuzu nambaye zinyanka.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Imana si umuntu apfa nkanje ku buryo noyihaririza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">canke ngo duharirire imbere y’intahe.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Ese iyaba hariho umuhuza hagati yanje na yo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">agashobora kutwicarika hamwe twempi,<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />agashobora kubuza Imana kunkubita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">igitinyiro cayo kikareka kuntera ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Ni ho nanje noshobora kuyivugisha ntayitinya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">Ariko si ko biri, ndi jenyene rudende.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Nzinutswe ubuzima bwanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ni co gituma ncura intimba ata kwigumya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ngasesa umururazi uri mu mutima wanje.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Mbwire Imana nti: Ntuntsindishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ariko niwerekane ico unyagiriza.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Mbega unezerejwe no kumpahaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">no gukengera igikorwa c’amaboko yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">mu gihe uriko uramwenyura uraba imigambi y’abanyakibi?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Mbega wewe ufise amaso nk’ay’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">canke ubona ibintu nk’uko abantu bapfa babibona?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Imisi yo kubaho kwawe ingana n’iy’abantu bapfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">canke imyaka yawe ingana n’iy’umuntu akomeye,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />ku buryo urondera kumenya ukugabitanya kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">no kubona ivyaha vyanje?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Urazi neza ko ata kibi kinyagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">kandi ko ata wushobora kunkiza ukuboko kwawe.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Wambumbishije ukuboko kwawe, ni wewe muremyi wanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Kandi ni wewe undanduye burundu.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Ibuka ko wambumvye mw’ivu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">none ugomba unsubize kuba ivu ubu nyene?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Mbega ntiwambitse kurya babika amata bagomba ko avura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">ukambumba kurya babumba isoro ry’amavuta?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Ni wewe wanyambitse umubiri n’inyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">nyubakisha amagufa n’imitsi.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Ni wewe wampaye ubuzima, unyereka n’urukundo rwinshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">Ukunyitaho kwawe ni kwo kwazigamye ubugingo bwanje.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Ariko iki ni co wagize ibanga mu mutima wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">kandi ndazi ko ibi wari ubifise mu vyiyumviro vyawe;<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />kugira ngo ninacumura, ube uriko uranyitegereza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">hanyuma ntureke ngo icaha canje kigende kidahanywe.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ewe ndagowe nimba hari ico nagirizwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Ariko naho noba nera, sinokwunamura umutwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">kuko nuzuye ibimaramare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">kandi nyitswa n’umubabaro wanje.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Iyo nunamuye umutwe, umpiga nk’uko bahiga intare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">kandi ukansukako ububasha bwawe butangaje.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Igihe cose wama uzana ivyagiriji bisha vyo kuntsindisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ukangwizako ubushangashirwe bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ibitero vyawe bikanzako nk’imipfunda yisubiriza.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />None ni igiki catumye unkura mu nda ya mama?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Iyo mpfuma mpfa ata wurankubita ijisho.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Iyo mpfuma mba uwutabayeho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">canke ngatwarwa mu mva nkiva mu nda ya mama.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Mbega sinsigaje imisi mike yo kubaho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Ehe nundeke na gatoya mpumeke,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />imbere y’uko nja iyo batagaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">mu gihugu c’umubabaro n’umwijima mwinshi,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />mu gihugu c’umwijima w’umuzitanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">umuzitanya urimwo umuvurungano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">aho umuco umeze nk’umwijima.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Zofari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Maze Zofari w’i Nayama na we yishura Yobu ati:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Mbega ayo majambo yose yogenda ata wuyishuye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Mbega umuntu yokwemerwa ko ari umugororotsi kubera amajambo yiwe menshi?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Ukwihayagiza kwawe kwotuma tunuma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Mbega nta n’umwe yokwubahuka kukwamira uriko uratukana?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Wewe ubwira Imana uti: ‘Ukwizera kwanje ntikugira agatosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">kandi uti ndera imbere yawe.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Ese icompa Imana ikagira ico ivuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">ikugurura akanwa kayo, ikakwishura.<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Mbega yokubwira amabanga y’ubwenge bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">kuko ubwenge bufise impande zibiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Ni ho womenya ibi: ko Imana yirengagije bimwe mu bigabitanyo vyawe.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Mbega woshobora gutahura amabanga y’Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Mbega womenya aho ububasha bw’Iyishoboravyose bugarukira?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Bugera hejuru y’amajuru; none wewe uri iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Bugera kure i bwina mu kuzimu; none wewe uzi iki?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Urugero rwabwo ni runini gusumba isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">bwagutse gusumba ibiyaga.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Mbega none igufashe ikagushira mw’ibohero</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">hanyuma ikagucira urubanza, ni nde yoyihaririza?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Nta gukekeranya, irazi abanyabinyoma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">kandi ibonye ikibi, none nta co yandika?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Umukehabwenge nta kuntu ashobora guhinduka umunyabwenge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">kurya indogoba y’inyeshamba, idashobora kuvyara umuntu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ariko weho, niwayegurira umutima wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ukayitarikira amaboko,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />ugashira kure icaha kiri mu biganza vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ukankira ikibi na kimwe kwarika mu mutima wawe,<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />ni ho uzohagarara ata soni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">uzohagarara wemye ata bwoba.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Uzokwibagira imibabaro yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">uzovyibuka kurya wibuka amazi yatemvye akarengana.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Ubuzima bwawe buzokayangana kurusha izuba ryo mu mashoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ijoro rizokubera nk’umutwenzi.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Uzoba impore kuko uzoba wagize ivyizigiro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">uzokwiraba biguhe gutekanirwa.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Uzoryama usinzire, nta n’umwe azogutera ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">Kandi benshi bazoza aho uri ngo ubafashe.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Ariko abanyakibi bazogenda bashira inkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">Nta ho bazohungira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">kandi ivyizigiro vyabo ni urupfu.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Yobu arasubira yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Ni ukuri umenga ni mwebwe muzi vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">kandi umenga nimwapfa ubwenge bwose buzoba bujanye namwe!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Ariko nanje mfise ubwenge nkamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">nta co munsumvya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Ni nde ayobewe ivyo vyose muriko muravuga?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Nabaye agatwengo kuri bagenzanje, naho nambaza Imana kandi ikantabara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">Naho bantwenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ndi umugororotsi, inyankamugayo.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Abaguwe neza bakengera abari mu magorwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">bagahenura abadandabagirana.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Amahema y’abambuzi ntakomakomwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">abacokora Imana baratekaniwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">inkomezi zabo ni zo bagize imana yabo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Nimubaze ibikoko, bizobigisha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">Mubaze inyoni zo mu kirere, zizobibabwira.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Canke uvugane n’isi, izokwigisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">canke mureke amafi yo mu biyaga ababwire.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Ni igiki muri ivyo vyose kitazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ko ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ari we yakoze ivyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ubuzima bw’ivyaremwe vyose buri mu biganza vyiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">co kimwe n’impwemu z’abariho bose.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Mbega ugutwi ntigusorongora amajambo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">nk’uko akanwa gatandukanya uburyohe bw’ivyokurya?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Ubwenge bufiswe n’abatama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">kandi ugutahura gufiswe n’abamaze imyaka myinshi.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Ubwenge n’inkomezi vy’ukuri ni ivy’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">kuja inama no gutahura ni ivyayo.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Ico isambuye ntigisubira kwubakwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">abo iboshe nta wushobora kubabohora.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Itumye imvura itara, haba ubugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">Iyirekuye na ho imyuzure ikwira isi.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Inkomezi no gutahura ni ivyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">kandi uwabeshwe n’uwabeshe, bompi ni abayo.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Ishorera abatware bari ibirenge bisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">abacamanza ikabanyaga ubwenge.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Abami ibambura inyambarabami zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">ikabambika umukanda mu rukenyerero gusa.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Abaherezi ibashorera nk’abaja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">igatembagaza abategetse kuva kera.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Izivya akanwa k’abizigiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">inararibonye ikazaka ugutahura.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Abahambaye ibambika agakengerwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">abanyenkomezi ikabambura ibigwanisho.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Ishira ahabona ivyihishije mu mwijima w’umuzitanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">igitutu c’umwijima gikomeye ikagihindura umuco.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Ni yo ikomeza amahanga, ikongera ikayasambura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">Ni yo iyagura ikongera ikayashwiragiza.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Abatware b’isi ibambura ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">bagasigara bayerera mu gahinga katagiramwo inzira.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Bagakabakaba mu mwijima utagira umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">bakadandabagirana nk’imborerwa.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Amaso yanje yabonye ivyo vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">amatwi yanje yavyumvise kandi nabitahuye.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Ivyo muzi nanje ndabizi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">nta co mundusha.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Ariko nshaka kwivuganira n’Iyishoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">niburanire n’Imana yonyene.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Ariko mwebwe mundementaniriza ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">mumeze nk’abaganga ata co bazi<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Iyo mupfuma munuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">ni ho mwari kuba mugize ubwenge.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Nimwumve ivyireguro vyanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">mutege amatwi ukuburana kw’iminwa yanje.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Mbega mwoburanira Imana mu binyoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">hamwe n’amajambo yanyu y’ubugunge?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Mbega Imana mwoyiburanira muhengamye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Mugaharira ku bwayo?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Aho mwibaza ko vyoborohera iseranguye ivyiyumviro vyanyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Mwibaza ko mwoyibesha nk’uko mubesha abantu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Ni ukuri ntizobura kubabaza ivyo mwakoze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">nimwagomba kuyiburanira muhengamye.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Mbega icubahiro cayo ntikibatera ubwoba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Mbega igitinyiro cayo ntikizobasumira?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Amajambo y’ubwenge yanyu afise agaciro nk’ak’umunyota.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">Imburano zanyu zifise inkomezi nk’iz’inkono z’ibumba.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Nimunume, mundeke mvuge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">bice aho bigomba.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Ni vyo, amagara yanje ndayafashe mu minwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">kandi mvuga ico niyumvira.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Naho yonyica, noguma ndayizigiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ariko ngira mburane imbere yayo.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ndazi ko ivyo bizomviramwo agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">kuko uwutubaha Imana atohagarara imbere yayo.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Tega amatwi mwumve amajambo yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">amatwi yanyu yumve ivyo mvuga.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Urubanza rwanje narushinze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">kandi ndazi ko nzorutsinda.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Mbega hari uwufise ico anyagiriza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Aho ni ho nonuma gushika mpfe.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Mana yanje, umpe ibi bintu bibiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">nanje sinzotinya kurenguka mu nyonga hawe.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Nkurako ikiganza cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">wongere ureke kunteza ubwoba igitinyiro cawe.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Hanyuma uheze uvuge, nanje ndishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">canke undeke mvuge, na we unyishure.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Mbega ibigabitanyo n’ivyaha vyanje bingana gute?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Nyereka ibicumuro n’ivyaha vyanje.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Ni kubera iki unyegeza mu nyonga hawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">ukamfata nk’umwansi wawe?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Mbega wotera ubwoba ikibabi kigururwa n’umuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">ukirukanga inyuma y’umuguruka wumye?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kuko ivyo unyandikako bimbera umururazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ukampanira ivyo nakoze mu buto bwanje.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Ibirenge vyanje wabiboheye mu mpatane z’ibiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ukurikirana intambuko zanje zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ugashingira akarimbi amakanda y’ibirenge vyanje.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ubuzima bwanje na bwo bubaye nk’igiti kibunzwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">bubaye nk’impuzu iriwe n’umuswa.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Umuntu wese yavyawe n’umugore, afise ubuzima bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">kandi bwuzuyemwo amagorwa.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Ashurika nk’ishurwe, hanyuma akuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">arengana kurya kw’igitutu, ntaramba.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />None wewe urashinga ijisho umuntu nk’uyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Umuntu nk’uyo womushira imbere y’intahe?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Ni nde yoshobora gukura ikintu cejejwe mu gihumanye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Nta n’umwe!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Imisi y’ukubaho kw’umuntu warayiharuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">washinze imisi n’amezi azobaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">umushingira umusi atazorengana.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Ehe reka kumushinga ijisho, arabe ko yoruhuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">mukureko igitsure cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">maze arangize ubuzima bwiwe nk’umukozi arangije akazi yahawe.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Njanye n’igiti coco: iyo giciwe, haba hariho ivyizigiro vyo gusubira kunaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">kandi iminago yaco ntibura.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Naho imizi yaco yosazira mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">igishitsi caco kikaborera mw’ivu,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />iyo cegereye amazi kiranaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">iminago yaco ikaba nk’imivyaro yatewe.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Ariko iyo umuntu apfuye, atakaza inkomezi ziwe zose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">Aracikana bikaba biheze.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Nk’uko amazi akama mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">inzuzi zikaburamwo n’ima zikagaduka,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />ni ko umuntu aryama ntiyikangure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">gushika aho amajuru azokurirwaho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">Ntazigera ava muri iryo tiro.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Ese icompa ukanyegeza mu mva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ukampisha gushika uburake bwawe buheze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Icompa ukanshingira igihe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">maze kigeze ukanyibuka!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Umuntu apfuye, mbega yosubira kubaho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Aho, nokwihanganiye imiruho ndimwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">nkarindira igihe canje co kwiyubura.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Wompamagaye nanje nkakwitaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">wokwiteganye igishika kumbona jewe gikorwa c’amaboko yawe.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Aho ndazi ko wokwihweje intambuko zanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">utiriwe urandika ivyaha vyanje.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Ibicumuro vyanje vyotekewe mu mufuko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">ugapfuka ukugabitanya kwanje.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Ariko nk’uko umusozi usenyuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">kandi nk’uko igitandara gikurwa aho kiri,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />amazi agakorogoshora amabuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">isuri igatembana umukungugu wo kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">ni ko ukuraho ivyizigiro vy’umuntu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Ubamara inkomezi uko umusi uje, gushika bagiye ubutakigaruka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">Uhinduranya mu maso habo, ukabarungika bakagenda.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Iyo abana babo bahawe icubahiro, nta vyo bamenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">iyo ababakomokako bacishijwe bugufi, nta vyo babona.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Nta kindi bumva atari imibabaro yo mu mibiri yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">hamwe n’ikigandaro bigandarira ubwabo.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Elifazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Elifazi w’i Temani na we arishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Mbega umunyabwenge yokwishura n’amajambo y’ubujuju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">akavuga nk’uwuzuye umuyaga wo mu buseruko?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Mbega yoburanisha amajambo atagira insiguro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">canke amajambo atagira agaciro?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Mbega nturuha utinya Imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">canke ngo uhinde agashitsi imbere yayo?<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Ivyaha vyawe ni vyo bisunika akanwa kawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">amajambo yawe ashingiye ku bugunge gusa.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Akanwa kawe ni ko kagutsindisha, si akanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">Iminwa yawe ni yo ikwagiriza.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Mbega ni wewe muntu wabayeho ubwa mbere?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Mbega watanze imisozi kuremwa?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Mbega warigeze wumva inama zihishijwe z’Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Canke ubwenge bw’Imana ni wewe ubwiharije?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Mbega uzi iki tutazi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Ugutahura ufise tudafise ni ukuhe?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Abatama bameze imvi bari ku ruhande rwacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">ndetse n’abashaje kurusha so wawe.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Mbega ntuhagijwe no kuremeshwa n’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">canke n’amajambo yiyoroheje yakubwiye?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Ni igiki cagutwaye ubwenge?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Ni igiki gitumye udukanurira amaso,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />ugahindukirira kugwanya Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">akanwa kawe kakavuga amajambo mabi nk’ayo?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Mbega umuntu buntu arashobora kuba uwera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Uwavyawe n’umugore arashobora kugororoka?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Nimba Imana itizigira n’abamarayika bayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">n’amajuru akaba atera imbere yayo,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />ku muntu buntu, yanduye kandi yononekaye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">Ku muntu akora ibibi nk’uwunywa amazi, we birarengeje!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Nyumviriza ndagusigurire neza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">ntega amatwi ndakwiganire ivyo nabonye,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />ivyemejwe n’abagenze bakabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">abakurambere bavyiganiwe na ba sekuruza babo,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />abahawe igihugu kera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ata bandi banyamahanga barakibamwo.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Umunyavyaha yama ababazwa ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">gushika imyaka yamushiriweho yo kubabazwa ikwiye.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Amajwi y’ibiteye ubwoba yama mu matwi yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">abambuzi bakamutera mu gihe c’impore.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Ntiyubahuka kuja hanze mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">kuko afise ikimenyetso c’uwicwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Ayerera arondera ivyokurya, avuga ati: ‘Ndabikura he?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">Kuko azi ko umusi w’umwijima umwegereje.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Amagorwa n’imibabaro bimwuzuza ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">bimurengera nk’umwami yitegurira kugwanya abamutera,<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />kuko yaforeye ingumu Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">akigira uwuhambaye imbere y’Iyishoboravyose,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />mu kwibona akaja kugwanya Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">yikingirije inkinzo yiwe, yitwaje n’inkota.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Naho uwo muntu atagase mu maso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">akagira ibinyonyori ku mafyinga,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />azoba mu bisagara vyasambutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">mu mazu yatawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">asigaje gato agahomvagurika.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Ntazokwama atunze, ubutunzi bwiwe ntibuzoramba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">kandi ivyo afise ntibizokwira mu gihugu cose.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Ntazigera ava mu mwijima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">iminago yiwe izobaburwa n’imbeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">kandi impwemu zo mu kanwa k’Imana zizomugurura.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Ntakibeshe mu kwizigira ibitagira ikimazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">kuko ata nyungu azobironkamwo.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Ivyo bizoba imbere yuko apfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">kandi amashami yiwe ntazoshurika.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Azoba nk’uruzabibu rwakuweko ibitumbwe vyarwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">canke imyelayo ihungurura amashurwe yayo yose.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Igihari c’abatubaha Imana kizoba ingumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">kandi umuriro uzotongora inzu y’abakunda ibiturire.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Basama inda z’imigumuko bakavyara ibibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">inda zabo zihingura ubugunge.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Maze Yobu asubizayo ati:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Ibintu nk’ivyo nari maze kwumva ni vyinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">kandi mwese muri abakene mu vyo gutera intege!<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Mbega amajambo yanyu asunitswe n’umuyaga ntagira iherezo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Hari ico navuze catumye muvuga urudaca?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Erega nanje nari gushobora kuvuga nkamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">iyo muba mwari mu kibanza canje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Nari kuvuga amajambo anoboye neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">nkabazungagiriza umutwe nitwengera.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Ariko jeho amajambo yanje yobateye intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">akanwa kanje kotumye muruhuka mu mitima yanyu.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Ariko ubu naho nogerageza kuvuga, umubabaro wanje ungumamwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">Kandi naho nonuma, nta co biri bumfashe.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Ni ukuri, Mana urankenyaguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">umariyeko abanje bose.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Wanteye iminkanyari, kandi nsigara ku magufa gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ukuzingama kwanje kunyagiriza imbonankubone.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Imana yaranteye itabagura umubiri wanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">Yarangwanije indira imisaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">intobekeranisha igitsure cayo.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Abantu na bo buguruye akanwa kabo baritwengera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">bankubita kw’itama bancokora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">bariyegeranya kugira ngo bangwanye.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Imana yandekuriye mu maboko y’abanyavyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">yantereye mu maboko y’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Nari nimererewe neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">maze irankenyagura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Yamfashe kw’izosi, imvunagura ata kigongwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">intumberezako imyampi yayo.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />Abarashi bayo banciye irya n’ino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">intobekeranya mu mafyigo ata kigongwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">amara yanje asanzara hasi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Intobagura ahantu hose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">ikantera imeze nk’umugwanyi.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Nishoneye amagunira ku mubiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">hanyuma ndihamba mu mukungugu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Amaso yanje atukujwe n’ukurira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">kandi umwijima utwikiriye ingohe zanje.<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Ariko nta kibi amaboko yanje yakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">kandi isengesho ryanje riratunganye.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Ewe wa si we, ntumire amaraso yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ukurira kwanje kuzokwame kwumvikana ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Mbere kugeza n’ubu icabona canje kiri mw’ijuru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">uwumburanira ashizwe hejuru.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Abagenzi banje ni bo bancokora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ariko amarira yanje ndayasukira Imana.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Mbega hari umuhuza yoja hagati y’umuntu n’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">nka kurya umuntu aja hagati y’umuntu n’uwundi?<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Kuko imyaka y’ukubaho kwanje igiye guhera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">mfate inzira y’ubutakigaruka.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Umutima wanje unshongeyemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">imisi yanje irashize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">Imva yiteze kunyakira.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Ni ukuri, abacokoranyi barankikuje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">amaso yanje ntagoheka kubera urwanko rwabo.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Mburanira, ewe Mana yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">kuko ata wundi ari ku ruhande rwanje.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Imitima yabo wayimye ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">ku bw’ivyo ntiwemere ko bagira intsinzi.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Ko badodobereza bagenzi babo kubera inyungu zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">abana babo bazicwa n’inzara.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Imana yangize iciro ry’imigani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">mpinduka uwo abantu bose bacira amate mu maso.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Amaso yanje ahumishijwe n’intuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">igikankara canje gisigaye kimeze nk’igitutu.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Abagororotsi bazobibona bumirwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">intungane zihagurukira abatubaha Imana.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Abagororotsi bazoguma mu nzira zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">n’intungane zizokwama zongerezwa inkomezi.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Ariko mweho, nimugaruke musubire mugerageze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ariko ndazi ko ata munyabwenge nsanga muri mwebwe.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Imisi yanje irarangiye, imigambi yanje yose ikuweho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">Ivyipfuzo vy’umutima wanje birapfuye.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Aba bagabo banyizeza ko ijoro ari umurango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">umwijima uje bavuga ko umuco ugira ushike.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />None ko ivyizigiro nsigaranye ari imva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">nkaba niteze gusasa uburiri bwanje mu mwijima,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />nkabwira ukubora nti: ‘Ni wewe Data,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">urunyo nkarubwira nti ‘Ni wewe Mama, ni wewe mushikanje,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />none ivyizigiro vyanje biri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Mbega hari uwobona na kimwe?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Ivyizigiro vyanje bizomanuka mu marembo y’i kuzimu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Nzojana na vyo mw’ivu.”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Biludadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Biludadi w’i Shuhi na we avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Mbega uzogeza ryari kuvuga ayo majambo yose?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Nuvuge ibiroranye nimba ugomba kwishura.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Ni iki gituma udufata nk’ibikoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">ukabona ko turi ibijuju imbere yawe?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Wewe witabagurana uburake bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">wibaza ko isi ica ihebwa kubera wewe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Canke ko igitandara gica gikurwa aho kiri?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Ni ukuri itara ry’umunyakibi rizozima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">n’urubeya rwiwe ruzohagarika kwaka.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Umuco wo mu nzu yiwe uzohinduka umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">urumuri rumanitse mu nzu yabo ruzozima<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Intambuko z’inkomezi ziwe zizopfunyapfunywa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">kandi imigabo yiwe ni yo izomutsinda hasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Ibirenge vyiwe ni vyo bimutwara mu mutego,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">bikamuta mu kinogo cimbwe mu nzira.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Umutego uzomufata ku gitsintsiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">ibiziriko bimubohe bimugumye.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Umugozi wo kumufata uhishijwe mw’ivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">umutego wiwe uryamye mu nzira.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Ibimutera ubwoba bizomukanga impande zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">bizomwoma ku birenge bimwiruke inyuma.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Ivyago biramwipfuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">ugutikiza kwiteze ko atsitara.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Ingwara zishishimuye umubiri wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">imfura z’urupfu zimuriye amaguru n’amaboko.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Azorandurwa mu rugo rwiwe yishimiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">ahonyangwe n’umwami w’ibiteye ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Umuriro uzokwama ku nzu yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">n’amazuku aturira azokwama akwiragiye aho aba.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Imizi yiwe izokwumira mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">na yo amashami yiwe yumire mu kirere.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Izina ryiwe rizokwibagirwa kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">mu gihugu nta wuzomwibuka.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Azokwirukanwa mu muco ajanwe mu mwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">azocibwa kw’isi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Ntazobona abana canke abuzukuru mu bwoko bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">nta wuzosigara aho azoba yarabaye.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Abazova mu burengero bazotangarira ibizomushikako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">abo mu buseruko bibatere guhinda agashitsi.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Bazovuga bati: ‘Ni ukuri aho ni ho mu nzu y’abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">ni co kibanza c’abataye Imana.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Yobu yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Mbega muzogeza ryari kumbabariza umutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">no kumvunaguza amajambo yanyu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Ubu bubaye ubugira cumi munyagiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">nta n’isoni mugira zo kunkorera ikibi.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Mbere naho noba naracumuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ico caha kiraba jewe.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Nimba mushaka kunyiratako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">mukantetereza kubera icaha canje,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />mumenye ko Imana ari yo yangiriye nabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">yamfatiye mu mutego.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Ndatakamba mvuga nti: ‘Ndarenganywa!’ Ariko nta wunyumva;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ndatabaza ariko nta wuncira urundenganura.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Yaranzibiriye inzira kugira ngo sindengane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">inzira yanje yayizibije umwijima.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Yankuyeko icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">anyambura urugori ku mutwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Yantabaguye impande zose gushika andangize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ivyizigiro vyanje yabiranduye nk’uwurandura igiti.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Uburake bwayo buranziriringiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">imparura mu bansi bayo.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Ingabo zayo zije aho ndi mu nkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">Ziranyugarije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">zisagaje hirya no hino y’inzu yanje.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Abavukanyi banje yabagize abanyamahanga kuri jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">abo twari tuzinanyi baranyihakanye.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Incuti zanje za hafi zaramvuyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">abagenzi banje baranyibagiye.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Abo mpaye indaro hamwe n’abakobwa bakora mu nzu bamfata nka kavantara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">bambona nk’umunyamahanga.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Umukozi wanje ndamuhamagara ntanyitabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">naho ndamwinginga n’akanwa kanje.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Impwemu zanje zinukira umugore wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">umuryango wanje na wo ndawushisha.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />N’abana bato barancokora.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">Iyo nserutse barantetereza.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Abagenzi banje bo ku mutima ndabashisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">abo nkunda banteye ibitugu.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Nsigaye ndi igikankara kiriko umubiri gusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">ni vyo vyonyene nsigaranye.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Nimungirire impuhwe bagenzi banje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">Nimungirire impuhwe kuko ukuboko kw’Imana kwankubise.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Ni kubera iki mumpama nk’uko Imana iriko irampama?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Mbega uko umubiri wanje umeze ntibihagije?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Ese amajambo yanje iyo aba yanditswe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">akandikwa mu gitabu,<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Ese iyo aba yandikishijwe ikaramu y’icuma kw’ibuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">agakorogoshorwa mu gitandara, akazokwamaho ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Ariko jeho ubwanje ndazi ko umucunguzi wanje ari muzima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">kandi ko impera n’imperuka azohagarara kw’isi.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Kandi ko naho umubiri wanje uzobora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">nzobona Imana ndi mu mubiri.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Nzoyibonera jewe ubwanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Ni ukuri nzoyibonera amaso mu yandi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Umutima wanje uruhijwe no kurindira ico gihe.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Iyo muvuze ngo: ‘Mbega twomuhiga gute?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">Ko umuzi w’ingorane ziwe uri muri we nyene,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Ahubwo mweho ndababwira ko mugowe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Kuko mwikwegera inkota mu ngeso zanyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Aho ni ho muzomenyera ko urubanza rubaho.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Zofari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Hanyuma Zofari w’i Nayama na we arishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Ivyiyumviro vyanje birazazaniwe none binteye kwishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">kubera yuko mpungabanye.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Numva wanyubahutse untesha agaciro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">none umutima wanje ungoberereye kugira ico mvuze.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Mbega ntuzi uko vyamye kuva kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">kuva umuntu agishirwa kw’isi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />ko intsinzi y’abanyakibi imara umwanya urume rumara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">kandi ko umunezero w’abatubaha Imana ari uw’akanya gato?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Naho ukwibona kwiwe kwoshika kw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">umutwe wiwe ugakora ku bicu,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />azohona ntiyongere kubaho, kurya kw’umwanda umuvamwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">Abamubonye bazobaza bati: Mbega yagiye he?<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Atumuka nk’indoto, ntabe agisubira kuboneka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">Azozimangana nk’ivyo umuntu arazirana mw’ijoro.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Ijisho ryamubonye ntirizosubira kumubona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">n’umuryango wiwe ntuzosubira kumubona.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Abana biwe bazosega aboro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">amaboko yiwe ni yo azosubiza ubutunzi yagunze abandi.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Inkomezi zo mu buto bwiwe zuzuye mu magufa yiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">zizojana na we mw’ivu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Naho ikibi gisosera akanwa kiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">akagihisha musi y’ururimi,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />akanka kugicira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">akakigumiza mu kanwa kiwe,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />ivyo yariye bizomuhinduka mu mushishito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">bibe nk’ubumara bw’inzoka mu nda yiwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Azodahwa ubutunzi yamiraguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Imana ntizemera ko bumugumamwo.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Azonunuza ubumara bw’inzoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">kandi ururimi rw’imvuvyi ruzomwica.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Ntazosubira kunezererwa inzuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">zimwe zitembamwo amata n’ubuki.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Ivyo yabiriye akuya azovyakwa atabiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ntazorya ku nyungu z’urudandazwa rwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Yatoteje aboro, agirako arabashibura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">Yinjiye amazu atubatse.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Yamana umunoho ntiyigera ahazwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">Kandi mu vyo yahahamiye, nta na kimwe kizosigara.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Nta casigaye atayongobeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ni co gituma ubutunzi bwiwe butazorama.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Naho akikijwe n’ivyuzuye, azosugerezwa n’intuntu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">Amagorwa azomuzako mu nkomezi zayo zose.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Niyamara kwuzuza inda yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Imana izomusukako uburake bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">izobumucuncuburirako nk’imvura.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Naho yohunga inkoni y’icuma y’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">umwampi w’umwakaka wayo uzomutobekeranya.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Azokwishikuramwo umwampi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">na wo uze ujejeta amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">maze atekerwe n’ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Ubutunzi bwiwe buzokamanganira mu mwijima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Umuriro w’icaduka uzomutongora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">urigite ibizoba bisigaye mu nzu yiwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Amajuru azogaragaza ibigabitanyo vyiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">isi na yo ihaguruke imugwanye.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Isegenya izohitana inzu yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">uburake bw’Imana bumuzeko nk’umukuba w’uruzi.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Iyo ni yo mpera Imana iha abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">ni ryo ragi yabageneye.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Yobu yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Nimutege amatwi amajambo yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">ripfume riba ihumure mumpaye.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Munyihanganire mvuge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">ninaheza muheze mwitwengere.”<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />“Mbega hari abantu nidodombeye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Icotuma nihangana ni iki?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Nimundabe hanyuma mutangare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">mushire ikiganza ku munwa mwumiwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Iyo niyumviriye ibi, ngira ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">umubiri wanje ugatetemera.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Ni kubera iki abanyavyaha baramba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">bagashika mu zabukuru, kandi bakaba abahambaye?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Barabona abana babo bakura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">bakanezerererwa abuzukuru babo.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Ingo zabo ziratekaniwe, kandi ntizigiramwo ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Inkoni y’Imana ntiri kuri bo.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Amapfizi yabo ntiyigera ahusha kwimya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">amashashi yabo avyara neza nta yiramburura.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Abana babo biginagura imbere yabo nk’imyagazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">kandi abana bato bama bariko baravyina.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Bama baririmba bavuza ingoma n’inanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">bakanezererwa amajwi y’imyironge,<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Bamara imyaka n’imyaka baguwe neza mu vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">hanyuma bakaja i kuzimu amahoro.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Ariko babwira Imana bati: ‘Tuveko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">ivy’inzira zawe nta vyo dukeneye.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Mbega Iyishoboravyose ni iki aho tuyikorera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Mbega kuyisenga vyotumarira iki?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Ariko ubutunzi bwabo si bo babwizigamira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">Ni co gituma nirinda imigambi y’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Mbega itara ry’abanyakibi hari aho ryigera rizima?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Hari icago kibagwako?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Mbega Imana ntibarengana iyo iriko irasuka umubabaro ku bantu?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Hari aho baramera nk’ivyatsi bigururwa n’umuyaga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">Canke nk’umuguruka utumurwa n’umuyaga?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Mweho muvuga muti: ‘Reka Imana izohana abana babo.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Ahubwo ikwiye guhana uwacumuye ubwiwe, akibonerako.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Amaso yiwe akibonera agatikizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">akanywa ku burake bw’Iyishoboravyose.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Mbega ibizoshikira abo yasize</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">hari ico bizoba bikimugize niyamara gupfa?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Mbega hari uwokwigisha ubwenge Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">kandi ari yo icira imanza n’abamarayika?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Bamwe bapfa bacuzuye inkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">bakiguwe neza, bari mu mahoro,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />imibiri yabo ikimeze neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">amagufa yabo akirimwo imisokoro.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Abandi bagapfana umururazi mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">batigeze babona iciza na kimwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Abo bompi bahambwa mu mva zimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">bakaribwa n’urunyo rumwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Erega ndazi ivyo mwiyumvira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">Ndazi ibibi vyose mwateguye kungirira!<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Murabaza muti: ‘Mbega inzu y’uwuhambaye iri he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">aho umunyakibi yahora aba ni he?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Murazobaza ingenzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">zizobabwira ukuri.<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Abanyakibi barazigamwa mu bihe vy’ivyago vy’ivyaduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">bagakingirwa uburake bw’Imana.<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Nta wubahangara ngo abagirize ibibi vyabo imbonankubone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">nta n’uwubasubiriza mu ndumane ivyo bakoze.<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Barapfa bagahambwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">imva zabo zikarindwa mu cubahiro.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Isi yo mu biyaya bahambwamwo imeze neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">umuntu wese akabaherekeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">amasinzi akabaja imbere.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />None mwebwe mwompoza amarira mute n’ayo majambo yanyu atagira insiguro?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Nta co musigaje kunyishura atari ibinyoma gusa.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Elifazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Elifazi w’i Temani na we yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Mbega umuntu yogirira akamaro Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Canke umunyabwenge yogira ico ayifashije?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Mbega wibaza ko ukugororoka kwawe gutuma Iyishoboravyose ihimbarwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Canke gutungana kwawe hari inyungu kwoyizanira?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Wibaza ko ifatira ku kugororoka kwawe mu kuguhana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">ikazana urubanza kuri wewe?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Haba na mba! Ni kubera ukugabitanya kwawe guhambaye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Ivyaha vyawe ntibigira uko bingana.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Watse ingwati benewanyu bidakwiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">ubambura imitamana yabo, ubasiga bari gusa.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Wimye amazi abanyotewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">abashonje ubima ico barya.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Wibajije kumbure ko abahambaye ari bo biganza mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">abatinyitse bakaba ari bo bakibamwo.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Abapfakazi wabahinda ata co ubahaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">uvunagura amaboko y’impfuvyi.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ni co gituma ukikujwe n’imitego,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">ubwoba bukagutera giturumbuka.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Kandi ni co gituma utabona kubera umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">imipfunda y’amazi ikaba yakurengeye.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Mbega Imana ntiri ahasumba amajuru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Itegereze n’ukuntu inyenyeri ziri hejuru kure cane.<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Ariko wibwira uti: ‘Mbega Imana izi iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Mbega yoshobora guca urubanza iri mu mwijima w’umuzitanya?’<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Wibwira ko ibicu biyikingiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">ko itoshobora kukubona iriko iratambuka inkikuro z’ijuru.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Mbega ugomba kuguma mu nzira za kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">izagenderwamwo n’inkozi z’ikibi?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Abo bacakiwe igihe cabo kitaragera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">amatanguriro yabo atwarwa n’umwuzure.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Babwira Imana bati: ‘Igirayo, tureke!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Mbega Iyishoboravyose hari ico yotugira?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kandi Imana ni yo yari yujuje ivyiza amazu yabo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">Ni co gituma nigira kure y’inama z’abantu nk’abo.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Abagororotsi bazobona uguhona kw’abanyakibi, banezerwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">abatagirizwa ikibi bazobatwengera mw’ijigo.<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />Bazogira bati: ‘Ni ukuri abansi bacu bararanduwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">Uwa nyuma muri bo atongowe n’umuriro.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />None rero niwiyunge n’Imana, ubone kuba amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">ni ho ivyawe bizogenda neza.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Niwumve amajambo yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">uyabike mu mutima<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Niwagaruka ku Mana Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ugakura ikibi cose mu muryango wawe,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />ugaheba iyo nyota y’ubutunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ugaterera inzahabu zawe mu ruzi,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />aho rero Iyishoboravyose izokubera ubutunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">ikubere n’ifeza z’agaciro.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Ni ho uzonezerererwa Iyishoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">ukunamurira amaso Imana.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Uzoyisenga na yo ikwumve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">wongere ushitse ivyo wayisezeraniye.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Ico uzokwipfuza gukora cose uzogishitsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">kandi umuco uzorasira mu nzira zawe.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Nimba abantu bari mu vyago, nawe ukavuga uti: ‘Batabare!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">Na yo izobatabara.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />N’abafise ibibi bagirizwa izobarokora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">bivuye ku kwera kw’amaboko yawe.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Yobu aca yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“No gushika uwu musi, amaborogo yanje aracari umururazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ikiganza ciwe kirandemereye kurenza amaborogo yanje.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Ese iyo mba nashobora kumenya aho noyisanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ese iyo mba noshika aho iba!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ngashinga urubanza rwanje imbere yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">akanwa kanje kagasesekara ukwiregura kwanje.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Kumbure nkumva ico yonyishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">nkiyumvira neza ku vyo imbariye.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Mbega yohangana nanje mu bubasha bwayo bukomeye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Haba na mba! Ahubwo yonyumviriza neza.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Kuko imbere yayo, umugororotsi arashobora kwiregura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">kandi aho nobohorwa ibihe vyose imbere y’umucamanza wanje.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Ariko ngiye mu buseruko sindayisangayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">naja mu burengero na ho nyenye sindayibone.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Iyo iriko ikorera mu buraruko, njayo sindayibone;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">nagaruka mu bumanuko na ho nyene sindayibona.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Ariko irazi inzira zanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">kandi niyamara kungerageza, nzosohoka meze bwa nzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Ibirenge vyanje vyagumye hafi y’intambuko zayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">kandi nagumye mu nzira zayo ntahengamiye i buryo canke i bubamfu.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Sinigeze nja kure y’ivyagezwe vyavuye mu kanwa kayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ahubwo amajambo yayo nayabitse neza kurusha ivyokurya vya misi yose.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Mbega ko ari yo Mana yonyene ifata ingingo, ni nde yoyihaririza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Ikora ico igomvye cose.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Ishira mu ngiro amabwirizwa yayo angwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">kandi imigabo nk’iyo yipfuza kunshitsako ni myinshi.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Ni co gituma mpindira agashitsi imbere yayo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">Iyo ndavyiyumviriye, ubwoba burantekera.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Imana ni yo idendebuye umutima wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Iyishoboravyose ni yo inciye ivutu.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Ariko sinzibwa akanwa n’umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">canke umuzitanya untwikiriye mu maso.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Ni iki gituma Iyishoboravyose idashiraho igihe c’imanza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Mbega ni kuki abayubaha barindira ivyo bihe bakabibura?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Abantu bashingura akarimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">bakaragira izo bivye,<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />bagasahura indogoba abakene n’impfuvyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">Agaka k’abapfakazi bagatwara nk’ingwati.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Bashiburira abakene inyuma y’inzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">aboro bo mu gihugu bakabahindira mu binyegero.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Aboro basigaye bameze nk’indogoba zo mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">birirwa barayerera barondera icobatunga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">Baronderera mu bugaragwa ico bagaburira abana babo.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Batunzwe n’ivyatsi vyo mw’ishamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">begeranya udusigazwa two mu nzabibu z’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Bagenda gusa, barara batipfutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">ntibagira ico bipfuka mu mbeho.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Imvura yo mu misozi ibahererako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">bakumira ku bitandara vy’amabuye kubera kubura ubwihisho.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Impfuvyi zonkorwa kuri ba nyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">abana b’impfuvyi bagafatwako ingwati.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Bagenda gusa ku kubura ico bambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">bikorera imiganda y’ingano ariko bakicwa n’inzara.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Bakanya imyelayo mu ngo z’abatunzi, bakaganira imitobe mu mato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">ariko bakicwa n’inyota.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Iminiho y’abacikana yumvikana mu gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">imitima yakomeretse ikaboroga itabaza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Ariko Imana nta n’umwe yagiriza ikibi.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Abanyakibi banka umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">bakirengagiza inzira zawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">Ntibazigera bazigumamwo.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Iyo bwije, umwicanyi arahaguruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">akica abakene n’aboro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">mw’ijoro na ho agasahura nk’igisuma.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Umusambanyi yikinga agahumbezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">akibwira ati: ‘Nta n’umwe aza kumbona.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">Yipfuka mu maso kugira ngo ntihagire uwumumenya.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Abasuma bamena amazu mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ku murango bakiyugarana bakaryama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">nta ho bahurira n’umuco.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Umwijima w’umuzitanya ni co gitondo cabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">umwijima uteye ubwoba ni wo mugenzi wabo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />Ariko bazoyonga nk’ifuro riyerera ku mazi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">Amatongo yabo aravumwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ntibagifata inzira ija mu nzabibu zabo.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Nk’uko uruzuba rutuma shelegi iyonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">ni ko imva inyakura abanyavyaha.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Inda zabavyaye zirabibagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">urunyo rukabagirako umusi mukuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Abanyakibi ntibibukwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">bamera nk’igiti kivunwa n’igihuhusi.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Bifatira abagore b’ingumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">kandi ntibafasha abapfakazi.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Imana, mu bushobozi bwayo, ikuraho abahambaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">naho womenga baratewe baramera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">nta kibemeza ko bafise ubuzima.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Ishobora kubareka bakidibamira nk’abafise umutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">ariko burya iba ishinze ijisho inzira zabo.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Bashirwa hejuru akanya gato, mu kandi kanya bakaba barangiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">bacishwa bugufi, bakegeranirizwa hamwe nk’abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">bagenywa nk’uwugenya ingano.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Nimba atari uko biri, Nihagire uwumpinyuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ahindure ubusa amajambo yanje.”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Biludadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Maze Biludadi w’i Shuhi arishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Inganji n’igitinyiro ni ivy’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">kandi ni yo itanga amategeko ahasumba amajuru.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Mbega inkomezi zayo zoharurwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Umuco wayo ni nde utarasira?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />None umuntu apfa, yogororoka gute imbere y’Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Uwavyawe n’umugore yoshobora ate gutungana?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Nimba mu nyonga zayo n’ukwezi kudakayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">n’inyenyeri ntizibe zitunganye mu maso yayo,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />mbega ntibirushirije ku muntu buntu, apfa akabora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">ku mwana w’umuntu asanzwe ari nk’umusiba?”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Maze Yobu yishura ati:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Ewe, urazi gufasha umunyantege nke!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Mbega ukuntu uzi kuramira ukuboko kudendebukiwe!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Impanuro uha imburabwenge ni iyihe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Canke ugutahura werekanye kuri he?<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Ni nde yagufashije gushikiriza ayo majambo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Izo mpwemu zavugiye mu kanwa kawe ni iza he?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Abapfuye bahindira agashitsi mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">amazi n’ibiyabamwo bikajugumira.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />I kuzimu hambaye ubusa imbere y’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">no mu mahonero ntakihakingiriye.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Amajuru yo mu buraruko iyasanza mu kirere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">igatuma isi yenena ku busa.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Itekera amazi mu bicu vyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">ariko ntibitoborwe n’uburemere bwayo<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Itwikira intebe yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">ikayipfukisha ibicu.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Amazi iyashingira akarimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">igashira imbibe hagati y’umuco n’umwijima.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Inkingi z’ijuru ziradegezwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">zikanzwe n’ugukankama kwayo.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Mu bubasha bwayo izikurura igihuhusi mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">kandi mu bwenge bwayo, igisizimwe igicamwo ubunywenywe.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Impwemu zayo zituma ijuru ryeyuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">ukuboko kwayo ikagusogotesha inzoka ihunga.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Kandi ivyo ni agace gato k’ivyo ishobora gukora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ni utwongoshwe dukeya gusa twumva.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">None ukwasana kwayo ni nde yoshobora kugutahura.”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Amajambo ya nyuma ya Yobu abwira abagenzi biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Maze Yobu abandanya avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Ndahiye ukubaho kw’Imana, yo nyene yanse kuncira urugororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">yo yanteye kurya ku mururazi wo mu mutima.<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Nkiri mu mubiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">ngihumeka impwemu z’Imana,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />akanwa kanje ntikazigera kavuga ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">kandi ururimi rwanje ntiruzovuga ibinyoma.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Sinshobora kubemerera ko muriko muvuga ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">Nzokwama mpagarariye ukugororoka kwanje gushika aho nzopfira.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Nzoguma mu bugororotsi bwanje, sinzigera ndabuvamwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">Ijwi ryo mu mutima wanje nta co ryigera rinyagiriza mu kubaho kwanje.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Umwansi wanje azomererwe nk’umunyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">uwungwanya na we azomererwe nk’uwugabitanya.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Mbega uwutubaha Imana yogira ivyizigiro bimeze gute Imana imuciye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ikamwaka ubugingo bwiwe?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Mbega Imana irumva amarira yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">iyo ivyago bibashitseko?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Umuntu nk’uwo yonezerererwa Iyishoboravyose?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Akama atabaza izina ry’Imana ibihe vyose?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Reka ndabigishe ivy’ubushobozi bw’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ivy’inzira z’Iyishoboravyose ntashobora guhisha.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Ko ibi vyose mwavyiboneye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">ni igiki gituma muvuga amajambo atagira ifatiro?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Iyi ni yo mpera Imana ibikiye abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ni wo mugabane bazohabwa n’Iyishoboravyose.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Naho yoba afise abana benshi, iherezo ryabo ni ukurigitwa n’inkota.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">Uruvyaro rwiwe ruzokwicwa n’inzara.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Abazosigara bazohitanwa n’ibiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">nta wuzosigara wo kubagandarira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">n’abapfakazi babo ntibazobaririra.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Naho yegeranya amafeza yiwe akangana n’imikungungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">akirundaniriza ivyambarwa nk’ibirundo vy’ibumba,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />ivyo azokwegeranya abagororotsi ni bo bazovyambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">abatakoze ivyaha ni bo bazogabangana amafeza yiwe.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Inzu yubaka zinyoganyoga nk’iz’ibitangurirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">ni nk’utururi tw’abarinzi.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Aryama ari umutunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">akikangura asanga ari umworo.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Ibiteye ubwoba bimuhwikira nk’imyuzure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">isegenya ikamutembana mw’ijoro.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Umuyaga wo mu buseruko uzomugurukana ntabe akiboneka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">uzomukubeba umukure mu rugo rwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Uzomuhuhutirako ata mbabazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">maze ayasamvye ahunga ububasha bwawo.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Abazobibona bazokoma amashi babitamba ku muvyimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">bivugirize agahwa nibababona bakurwa mu vyabo.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Intangamarara: Mbega ubwenge bwoboneka he?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Ni ukuri hama hariho ahantu bimba ifeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">n’ahantu bavugutira inzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Ubutare babwimba mw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">umujumbu na wo mu bisate vy’urutare rwawo bishongeshejwe.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Abantu bazi ingene bashira umuco ahari umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">bakawinjiramwo gushika aho ugera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">bagashika no mu muzitanya w’urupfu barondera amabuye y’agaciro.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Bimba ivyobo birebire kure y’aho abantu baba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">aho ata kirenge c’umuntu kihashika.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">Bakavyururukamwo ku migozi bazungeta hirya no hino.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Iyi si ni yo imerako ivyokurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">ariko i kuzimu hayo hameze nk’ahahindaniramwo umuriro.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Ibitandara vyaho bivamwo utubuye tw’agaciro twitwa lapisi lazuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">umukungugu waho urimwo utuvunguka tw’inzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Ibisiga vyo mu kirere ntibizi inzira ija aho hantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">n’amaso y’agaca ntaraharabukwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />N’ibikoko vyibona ntibirahahonyoza ikirenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">n’intambwe ntirahahonyoza ijanja.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Abantu basatura ibitandara vy’amabuye y’amasare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">bagasenyura imisozi bahereye mu ntango zayo.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Baca imyobo mu bitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">amaso yabo akabona ubutare bunyegejeyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Bagomera inzuzi zigakama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">bagashira ahabona ivyihishije.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Ariko ubwenge bwo buboneka hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ugutahura bogusanga hehe?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Abantu ntibazi agaciro kabwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">kuko ntibubonerwa mw’isi y’abazima.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />I kuzimu havuga hati: “Nta buri hano.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">Ikiyaga kikavuga giti: “Ntibuba iwanje.”<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Ntibugurwa inzahabu ziramuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">canke ngo buguzwe ibilo vy’ifeza.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Ntibugurwa n’inzahabu ziva muri Ofiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">canke utubuye tw’agaciro twitwa onigisi canke lapisi lazuli.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Inzahabu canke ayandi mabuye y’agaciro ntivyogereranywa na bwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">n’ivyakozwe mu nzahabu ntivyoguzwa na bwo.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Amabuye y’agaciro yitwa korayi na yasipi ntivyoruha bigereranywa na bwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">agaciro kabwo gasumba imaragarita.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Ubwenge ntibwogereranywa n’amabuye y’agaciro yitwa topazi yo muri Etiyopiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">kandi ntibwogurwa inzahabu ziramuye.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />None ubwenge buva he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ugutahura kuba he?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Bunyegejwe amaso y’ibifise ubuzima vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">buhishijwe inyoni zo mu kirere.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Gatikizo na Rupfu biravuga biti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">Twumvise ibihuha vyabwo gusa.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Imana ni yo izi inzira ijana iyo buri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">ni yo yonyene izi aho buba,<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />kuko ibona ku mpera z’isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">ikabona n’ibiri musi y’ijuru.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Igihe yashiraho inkomezi z’umuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">ikagena uburemere bw’amazi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />igaha amategeko imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">imiravyo ikayiha inzira,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />Ni ho yitegereza ubwenge ikabugera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">irabusuzuma, iremeza agaciro kabwo.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Maze ibwira abantu iti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">“Ukwubaha Imana ni bwo bwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">kandi ukuva mu vyaha ni kwo gutahura.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu yisigura Ubwa nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Maze Yobu abandanya avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Icompa ngasubira kuba nk’uko nari mbayeho mu mezi aheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">aho inyonga z’Imana zahora kuri jewe,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />aho itara ryayo ryakira hejuru yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">umuco wayo ukandongora mu gihe c’umwijima.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Icompa ngasubira muri ya misi nari nteye imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">aho ubucuti nari mfitaniye n’Imana bwahezagira inzu yanje.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Ico gihe Iyishoboravyose yari ikiri kumwe nanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">kandi abana banje bari bankikuje.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Ico gihe inka zanje zakamwa menshi cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">kandi amato yanje yari asesekaye amavuta ya elayo.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Ngiye mu nama y’abatware b’igisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">nicarana n’abubahwa kw’ihuriro,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />abatware bakiri bato bakikuma, bakampa inzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">inararibonye zikanyakira zihagurutse.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Abaganwa bagahagarika inkuru zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">bagashira ikiganza ku munwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Abatware b’abubahwa bagahaguruka bacereje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ururimi rwabo rukagobwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Abanyumva bose bamvuga neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">kandi abambona bose banshingira intahe,<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />kuko nafasha abakene n’impfuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">hamwe n’abatagira gitabara.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Nahezagirwa n’abacikana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">imitima y’abapfakazi nkayuzuza indirimbo z’umunezero.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Nambara ukugororoka nk’umwambaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">ubutungane yari yo kanzu n’inkofero vyanje.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Nabera amaso impumyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ibimuga nkabibera amaguru.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Nari se w’abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">naburanira ba kavantara.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Navunagura imibangabanga y’ababisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">nkabambura abo bashinzeko amenyo.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Nahora nibaza nti: ‘Nzopfira mu nzu yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">imisi yanje izongana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga.’<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Nzoba meze nk’igiti gishorera imizi yaco mu mazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">ikime co mw’ijoro kigatonyangirira ku mashami yanje.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Ubwiza bwanje bukama bwiyubura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">n’inkomezi zanje zikiyubura ku musi ku musi.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Abantu bose bantega amatwi bashaka kwumva ivyo mvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">bakarindira impanuro zanje bacecetse.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Mpejeje kuvuga, nta wasubizayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">amajambo yanje yashika ku nyota abantu bose.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Banyitega nk’abitega imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">bakipfuza ko novuga kurya abantu bipfuza ko imvura yogwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Ndabatwengeye vyarabarengera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">kuko ukubakera mu maso kwanje kwari gufise ikimazi kuri bo.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Ni jewe nabereka inzira bakwiye gucamwo, nkababera umurongozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">nari meze nk’umwami ari hagati mu ngabo ziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">nari kiremesha ku bafise imitima ibabaye.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Ariko noneho abo naboneye izuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ni bo bariko baranshinyagurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">abo nakengerera ba se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ntobashize no mu mbwa zirarira ibitungwa vyanje.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Mbega inkomezi zabo hari ico zomariye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">ko amaboko yabo yabaye goyigoyi.<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Bazingamitswe n’ubukene n’inzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">baguguna imisozi igadutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ahantu h’ubugaragwa, hatawe.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Ivyatsi vyo mw’ishamba ni vyo mboga zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">imizi y’ibiti ikaba ivyokurya vyabo.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Baciwe mu bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">barenganye bagahabwa akaruru nk’ibisuma.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Vyatumye bahindirwa ahahora haca inzuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">mu masenga no mu binogo.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Babirira mu mashamba nk’ibikoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">bakarundanira hamwe musi y’ibiti<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Ni abana b’ibipfu batoharurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">birukanywe mu gihugu cabo.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />None abana babo ni bo bariko banshinyagurira mu ndirimbo zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">nabaye iciro ry’umugani muri bo.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Baranzinutswe, banyigiwe kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">kandi ntibatinya no kuncira amate mu maso.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Ubu ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabohoye umuheto wanje, akanyuzuza umubabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">vyabananiye kwigumya imbere yanje.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />I buryo imburakimazi zampagurukiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">batega imitego ibirenge vyanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">Barampagurukiye ngo bamfate.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Inzira yanje barayizibiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">bangwijijeko ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">kandi nta n’uwuri bubabuze.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Banteye bazananye mu kirengero kinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">banshikiriye baciye ku bihomoke.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Ibiteye ubwoba biransugereje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">icubahiro canje gitwawe n’umuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">Ubutunzi bwanje bukamanganye nk’igipfungu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />None ubuzima bwanje buriko buranshiramwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">ibihe vy’imibabaro vyancakiye.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Ijoro rimpekenya amagufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">uburibwe ntibunduhurira.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Mu nkomezi zayo, Imana yancakiye mu kanigo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">imfata nk’uko impuzu ifata izosi<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Yamvumbagaje mu vyondo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">mpinduka nk’umukungugu n’umunyota.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Ndagutakambira, ewe Mana yanje, ariko ntunyishura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Mpagarara imbere yawe, ariko ntunandaba.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Wambereye inkazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi kurangwanya.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Ungurura mu muyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">unyukaguriye mu nkubi y’umuyaga.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Ndazi neza ko uriko untwara mu rupfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">ari ho mw’ihuriro ry’abafise ubuzima bose.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Ugira ngo iyo umuntu ariko aratemba ntiyaya amaboko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">Canke amagorwa amuteye, ntatabaza?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Mbega jewe sinaririra abari mu vyago?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Umutima wanje ntiwarirana n’aboro?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Ariko naba niteze iciza, ikibi akaba ari co citanganiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">nitega umuco, hakaza umwijima.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Umutima wanje uri mu ruhagarara, mbuze uburuhukiro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">Ibihe vyo kubabazwa vyanshikiye.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ngendera mu muzitanya, simbona izuba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">Mpagarara mw’ikoraniro, ngatabaza.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Nabaye mwenewabo n’imbwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">ndi umugenzi w’ibihuna.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Uruhu rwanje ruriraburanirwa, rugashishagurika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">umubiri wanje uturiwe n’inyonko.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Inanga yanje isigaye ari iyo gucura intimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">umwironge wanje na wo wahindutse ijwi ry’abarira.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Nagiraniye isezerano n’amaso yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">ryo kutazorabana ukwipfuza umwigeme.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Mbega umugabane noronka uvuye mw’ijuru ku Mana woba uwuhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Iragi ryanje riva hejuru ku Yishoboravyose ryoba irihe?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Mbega si uguhona kw’umunyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">n’ivyago bikurikirana uwukora ibigabitanyo?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Mbega ntibona ivyo nkora vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">igaharura intambuko zanje zose?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Nimba naragendeye mu binyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">ibirenge vyanje bikihutira kubesha abandi,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Imana ninshire ku munzane w’ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">ndazi ko izobona ukugororoka kwanje.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Nimba ibirenge vyanje vyarataye inzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">umutima wanje ugatwarwa n’ivyo amaso yanje yabonye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">canke amaboko yanje agakora ikindi caha na kimwe,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />imirima yanje iragasoromwa n’abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">barandure n’ivyo nateye.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Nimba umutima wanje warakwegakwezwe n’umugore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">canke nkipfuza umugore w’umubanyi wanje,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />umugore wanje aragasyera uwundi mugabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">afatwe ku nguvu n’abandi bagabo.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Kuko nzoba nakoze igiterasoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">icaha gikwiye guhanwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Ico caha ni umuriro utongora ugahonya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">corandura ivyo mfise vyose.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Nimba nararenganije umukozi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">nkanka kwumviriza ivyo anyitwarako,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />nzobigenza gute Imana niyaza kubatabara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Nzoyishura iki niyabimbaza?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Mbega Imana yandemye si yo yabaremye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Si yo yatubumbiye mu nda za ba mama twese?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Mbega naranse gufasha abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">nirengagiza imibabaro y’abapfakazi?<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Noba narisangije ivyokurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">nanka kubisangira n’impfuvyi?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Ahubwo kuva nkiri muto namye ndera impfuvyi nka se wazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">kuva nkiva mu nda ya mama nitaho abapfakazi.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Nimba hari uwo nabonye yicwa no kubura ico yambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">canke umukene yabuze umutamana,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />hanyuma umutima wiwe ntumpezagire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">kubera ko atasusurukijwe n’ikoti y’ubwoya bw’intama zanje,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />kandi asangwa naragiriye nabi impfuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">nitwaje igikenye c’ubucamanza,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ukuboko kwanje kuragatandukana n’igitugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">kurakavunikira mu ngingo.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Kuko naratinya ko Imana yonteza ivyago biteye ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">kandi ku bw’icubahiro cayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">sinokwubahutse gukora ikintu nk’ico.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Nimba narizigiye inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">nkabwira inzahabu ziramuye nti: ‘Uri ubutunzi bwanje,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />nimba umunezero wanje uva mu butunzi bwanje bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">no mu vyo amaboko yanje yarondeye,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />nimba naritegereje ugukayangana kw’izuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">nkabona ukwezi ingene kugendera mu nzira zakwo z’ifeza,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />maze umutima wanje ukaremeshwa mu mpisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">hanyuma nkabisenga,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />ivyo na vyo vyombereye ivyaha vyo guhanwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">kuko nobaye mpakanye Imana iri hejuru.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Sinigeze nezerererwa ivyago vy’umwansi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">canke ngo mpimbarwe agize ingorane,<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />sinigeze nemerera akanwa kanje gucumura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">canke guhamagara imivumo ku buzima bwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />N’abakozi bo mu nzu yanje ntibigeze bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Ni nde atarahazwa n’inyama za Yobu?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Nta munyamahanga naraje hanze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">kuko inzu yanje yama yugururiwe ingenzi.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Sinigeze nyegeza icaha canje nk’uko abandi babigenza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">sinigeze ndagihisha mu mutima,<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />ndabitewe no gutinya amaso y’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">canke gutinya iyindi miryango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">hanyuma ngo ninumire, nigumire i muhira.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Icompa hakagira uwunyumva, akaba ku ruhande rwanje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Nshize umukono ku vyireguro vyanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Iyishoboravyose ninyishure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">umwansi wanje na we ni yandike ibirego vyiwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Ni ukuri novyiremeka ku rutugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">nkavyambara ku mutwe nk’urugori.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Kuko nomwiganira ido n’ido ry’ivyo nakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">nohagarara imbere yiwe meze nk’umuganwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Nimba mu mirima yanje hatakamba handega,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">ubusize bwaho bwose bukarira,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />nimba narariye ivyeze vyaho ntabirishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">canke nkica beneho,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />harakamerera amahwa mu kibanza c’ingano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">n’ishamba ahobaye sayiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Amajambo ya Yobu aba ahereye aho.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Maze ba bagabo uko ari batatu bahagarika kwishura Yobu, kuko we ubwiwe yabona ko ari umugororotsi. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Ariko Elihu mwene Barakeli w’i Buzi mu muryango w’Abaramu akarira Yobu cane kuko yari yanse kwemera ko yakoze ivyaha, kandi ntiyemera ko Imana itamurenganije mu kumuhana. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Yongera akarira bagenziwe batatu kuko bananiwe no gutsinda Yobu ariko bakagiriza ikibi Imana. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu yari yabanje kureka bagenziwe baravuga, kuko bamusumba mu myaka. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Ariko abonye amajambo yabaheranye, uburake bwiwe buraziriringa.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Maze Elihu mwene Barakeli w’i Buzi, aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Jewe ndi muto mu myaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">mwebwe murakuze cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">Ni co gituma nigumije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">sinubahuka kubabwira ico niyumvira.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nahora nibaza nti: ‘Aba kera ni bo bakwiye kuvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">kandi abo hambere ni bo bakwiye kwigisha ivy’ubwenge.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Ariko nasanze ari impwemu y’Imana iba mu muntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">itanga ugutahura.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Abatama si bo bonyene bazi ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">n’abakuze si bo bonyene bafise ugutahura.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Ni co gituma ndababwira nti: Nimunyumvirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">nanje ndababwire ico niyumvira.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Nabarindiriye mukiriko muravuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">nkiyumvira ku vyiyumviro vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">mukirondera amajambo mukoresha.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Nabumvirije neza mwese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">ariko nta n’umwe nigeze numva atsinda Yobu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">canke ngo ashobore kumwishura ku majambo yiwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Kandi ntimumbwire muti: ‘Twasanze ari umunyabwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">none reka Imana yo nyene ibe ari yo imwiyishurira.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Iyaba Yobu yariko araharira nanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">sinari kumwishura mu majambo nk’ayanyu.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Ehe raba murumiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">murabuze ico musubizayo.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />None ngume numye ko mwabuze ico muvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">ko mbona muhagaze ata co muvuga?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Nanje ndafise ico novuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">reka ndababwire ico niyumvira.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Kuko numva nuzuye amajambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">kandi numva umutima unsunikira kuyavuga.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Numva meze nk’umukuza w’urusato wuzuye umuvinyu mushasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">uvyimvye, ugomba guturika.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Reka mvuge kugira ngo ntenzukirwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">Reka nteranure akanwa kanje nishure.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Ngira mvuge ata ho mpengamiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">kandi nta n’umwe nshobora guhema,<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />kuko iyaba nari nzi guhemana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">umuremyi wanje yondanduye nk’aka kanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />None rero Yobu we, niwumve ivyo mvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">utege ugutwi amajambo yanje yose.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Ngira nteranure akanwa kanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">ururimi rwanje ruvuge amajambo.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Amajambo yanje ava mu mutima ugororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">mvugisha ukuri.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Mpwemu w’Imana ni we yambumvye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">impwemu z’Iyishoboravyose ni zo zampaye ubugingo.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Unyishure nimba uza kubishobora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">witegure duhangane.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Imbere y’Imana ndi co kimwe nawe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">Nanje naremwe mw’ibumba.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Ni co gituma udakwiye kuntinya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">nta cubahiro mfise cotuma ugira ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Ni ukuri wavuze numva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">kandi niyumviye amajambo yawe.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Wavuze uti: ‘Ndi umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">nta caha kindiko.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Ariko Imana yama ifise ivyo inyagiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">ikama imfata nk’umwansi wayo.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Ibohera ibirenge vyanje mu mpatane z’ibiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ikarerekesha ijisho intambuko zanje.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Ariko nokubwira ko utari mu kuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">kuko Imana ihambaye gusumba umwana w’umuntu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Ni iki kigutuma uyidodombera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">uvuga ko itishura ku majambo yawe?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Ariko Imana yama iriko iravuga, rimwe muri ubu buryo, irindi mu bundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">naho ata n’umwe agira ishaka ryo kubimenya.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Ivugira mu nzozi, mu ndoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">iyo abantu basinziriye itiro ryinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">iyo baryamye ku bitanda vyabo.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Ibongorera mu matwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">igatuma baterwa ubwoba n’ivyo ibaburiye.<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Kugira ngo bahindure imigabo yabo mibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">ikabarinda ubwibone.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Ibarinda kuja mu mva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">n’uko ubuzima bwabo bwicwa n’inkota.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Canke naho Imana igahanira umuntu ku buriri bw’imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">imuteje uburibwe budahera bwo mu magufa,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />akabura akayabagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">akazinukwa n’ibiryoshe cane.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Umubiri wiwe ugahinduka ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">amagufa yiwe yahora yihishije akaja ahabona.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Umushaha wiwe ukegera rwa rwobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">ubuzima bwiwe bukegera intumwa z’urupfu.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Ariko habonetse umumarayika avuye mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">akamuvugira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">akemeza ko ari umugororotsi,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Imana imugirira ubuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">ikavuga iti: ‘Nimumurekure, ntimumwice!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">Naronse impongano y’ubugingo bwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Maze umubiri wiwe ugasubira kuba nk’uw’uruyoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">ugasubira itoto nko mu buto bwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Asenze Imana, na yo iramwishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">akabona mu nyonga z’Imana anezerewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Imana ikamusubiza mu kugororoka kwiwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Maze akaza aririmba imbere y’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">avuga ati: ‘Naracumuye, ngoramika ivyari bigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">ariko Imana ntiyampanishije ibihwanye n’ivyo nakoze.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Yarokoye ubugingo bwanje ntibwaja mu rwobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">none ubugingo bwanje bwabonye umuco.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Ivyo vyose Imana ibikorera umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">incuro ya mbere, iya kabiri, n’iya gatatu.<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />Ibakiza urupfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">kugira ngo bagendere mu muco w’abazima.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />None rero Yobu, untege amatwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ucereze nanje mvuge.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Nimba ufise ico uvuga, nunyishure.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">Nuvuge, kuko nipfuza kukuburanira.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ariko niwaba ata co ufise uvuga, nyumviriza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">Cereza ndakwigishe ubwenge.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Elihu arongera avuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Nimwumve amajambo yanje mwa banyabwenge mwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">Munyumvirize yemwe abafise ubumenyi.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Kuko ugutwi gutandukanya amajambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">nk’uko ururimi rwumviriza indya.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Reka turabe ikibereye twebwe nyene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">Ingo twige iciza ico ari co.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Yobu avuga ati: ‘Ndi umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">Imana ni yo indenganya.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Naho ndi umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ibona ko ndi umubeshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">Naho ata co nokwagirizwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">imyampi yayo intera ibisebe bidakira.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Mbega ni nde yomera nka Yobu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">agotomera ibitutsi nk’uwunywa amazi!<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Agendera mu gihari c’inkozi z’ibibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">akifatanya n’abagabitanya.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Kuko yibwira ati: ‘Nta co bimarira umuntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">kugerageza kunezera Imana.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />None rero nimuntege amatwi, yemwe abafise ugutahura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Birazwi ko Imana idakora ivyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">kandi ko Iyishoboravyose idakora ikibi.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Isubiriza umuntu mu nkoko ibikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">ikishura umuntu ibihwanye n’ingeso ziwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Mu vy’ukuri Imana ntiyigera ikora ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">kandi Iyishoboravyose ntigoramika urubanza.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Ni nde yayiragije isi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Ni nde yayijeje ibiri kuri yo vyose?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Hamwe Imana yotwara impwemu yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">igakuraho uguhumeka muri twebwe,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />abari n’ubugingo bose bohonera rimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">abantu bose bosubira mu mukungungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Nimba ufise ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">niwumve ivyo mvuga.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Mbega uwanka guca izigororotse yoganza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Woshobora gucira urubanza uwugororotse ari na we Munyenkomezi?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Mbega si we abwira abami ati: ‘Muri imburakimazi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">akabwira abubahwa ati: ‘Muri inkozi z’ikibi.’<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Igitinyiro c’abantu ntikimutera ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">abatunzi ntabarutisha abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">kuko bose baremwe n’ibiganza vyiwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Bapfa mu kanya isase, bakagenda mu gicugu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">Abantu baranyiganyizwa hanyuma bagapfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">abakomeye bagenda ata wubakozeko.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Amaso yayo ari ku vyo abantu bakora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">akabona intambuko zabo zose.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Nta mwijima w’umuzitanya, canke igitutu gikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">inkozi z’ikibi zokwinyegezamwo amaso yayo.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Imana ntikeneye amatohoza adasanwe ku muntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">kugira ngo arenguke mu rubanza imbere yayo.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Irandura abahambaye ata we ibajije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">hanyuma ikabasubiriza abandi,<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Ibona ibikorwa vyabo vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">kandi mu gicugu kimwe irabubika, ikabafyonyora.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Ibahanira ivyaha vyabo ku mugaragaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">aho abantu bose bababona.<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Kuko bataye inzira bakebeje bakayiva inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">ntibaba bacitaho inzira zayo.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Batumye amarira y’aboro ashika imbere y’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">kuko ni Imana yumva amarira y’abakene.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Ariko hamwe yokwinumira, ni nde yoyiburanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Inyegeje mu maso hayo ni nde yoyibona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Uko irengeye umuntu, ni ko irengeye ihanga.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Ikura abatayubaha ku ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">kugira ngo ntihagire abantu bagwa mu mitego yabo.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Hamwe umuntu yobwira Imana ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Naracumuye, ariko sinzosubira.’<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Canke ati: ‘Sinzi neza icaha nakoze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">nimba nakoze ikintu kibi kinyereke sinze nsubire kugikora.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Mbega Imana yoguha impera kubera ivyo vyiyumviro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">mu gihe woba wanse kwihana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Nabe ari wewe wiyumvira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">utubwire ico uzi.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Umuntu afise ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">hamwe n’incabwenge bazonyumva, bavuge bati:<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Yobu avuga ivyo atazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">amajambo yiwe ntagiramwo ubwenge.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Yobu nageragezwe gushika kw’iherezo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">kuko yishuye nk’abanyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Icaha ciwe acongerako ubugarariji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">akomera muri twebwe amashi yo gucokorana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">agwiza amajambo yo kugwanya Imana.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Maze Elihu arongera aravuga ati:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Wibaza ko uri mu kuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">ko uvuga ngo ‘Ndi umugororotsi imbere y’Imana?’<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Ariko urabaza uti: ‘Mbega vyomarira iki kugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">kandi vyomarira iki kubaho ntakora icaha?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Reka ndakwishure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">nishure n’abagenzi bawe.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Rangamiza kw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">urabe ingene ibicu biri kure hejuru yawe.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Wibaza ko ukoze icaha hari ico vyoyigira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Ivyaha vyawe bibaye vyinshi, hari ico vyoyitwara?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Mbega uyigororokeye woba uyihaye iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Yoronka iki mu biganza vyawe?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Haba na mba. Ivyaha vyawe vyonona abantu nka wewe nyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">kandi ubugororotsi bwawe bwofasha umwana w’umuntu gusa.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Iyo agacinyizo kabaye kenshi, amarira aba menshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">Bataka barondera ububasha bw’umunyenkomezi.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Ariko nta n’umwe abaza ati: ‘Mbega Imana umuremyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">yo impa indiririmbo mw’ijoro,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />ikatwigisha gusumvya uko yigisha ibikoko vyose vyo kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ikatugira abanyabwenge gusumvya inyoni zo mu kirere, iri hehe?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Iyo basemereye Imana ntibishure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">biba vyatewe n’ukwishira hejuru kw’umunyakibi.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Mu vy’ukuri, Imana ntiyumva amasengesho agaragara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Iyishoboravyose ntibishirako umutima.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Mbega ntizorushiriza kutakwumva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ko uvuga ngo ntuyibona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">ko uvuga ngo izi urubanza rwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ariko ikakurindiriza cane,<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />ukongera ukavuga ko uburake bw’Imana budahana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ko idashira umutima ku kibi.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Yobu yugururiye akanwa kuvuga amajambo y’imburakimazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">yagwije amajambo y’ubupfu.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu arabandanya ati:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Subira unyihanganire gato ngusigurire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">kuko ngifise ivyo kuvuga ku vyerekeye Imana.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Reka nguhe uturorero twinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">ku kugororoka kw’Umuremyi wanje.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Ivyo nkubwira ni ukuri kugaragara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">kuko jewe ndi i ruhande yawe mfise ubumenyi bukwiye.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Imana ni Inyabushobozi, ariko ntisuzugura abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">ni Inyabushobozi mu bwenge bwayo.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Ntiyirengagiza umunyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">kandi umukene imucira izibereye.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Inyonga zayo ntiziva ku bagororotsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ibicarikana n’abami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ikabashira hejuru ibihe vyose.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Ariko iyo abantu baboshwe n’iminyororo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">bakabohwa n’imigozi y’imibabaro,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />Imana igaragaza ivyaha vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">ivyo bakoreye mu bwibone bwabo.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Ibazibura amatwi ngo batahure ivyo ibabwira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">maze ikababurira ngo bave mu bibi.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Bayumviye bakayikorera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">bazomara imisi yose basigaje kubaho baguwe neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">imyaka yabo izoba iyo guhimbarwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Ariko batayumviye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">bazicwa n’inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">bongere bicwe n’ubujuju.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Abatubaha Imana babohwa n’ishavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">kandi iyo ibahanye, ntibanayambaza ngo ibatabare.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Bapfa bakiri bato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">bakagwa hamwe n’abamaraya bo mu ngoro z’ibigirwamana<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Ariko abababaye ibakirisha mu mibabaro yabo nyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">ikavuganira na bo mu mibabaro yabo.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Imana iriko irakwiyegereza ngo igukure mu mibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">ngo igutware ahiyaguye mu mwidegemvyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">ngo ugubwe neza ku meza yawe iriko ivyokurya bitoranijwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Ariko noneho ufashwe n’urubanza rucirirwa abanyavyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">urubanza n’ukuri biragutsinze.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Wirinde ntihagire uwugukwegesha ubutunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">ntiwemere ko igiturire kiguhindukiza.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Mbega ubutunzi bwawe canke inkomezi zawe vyokuzigama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">bikagukiza imibabaro?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Ntukipfuze ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">aho abantu baburirwa irengero mu ngo zabo.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Wirinde ntusubire mu bibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">kuko bisa nk’aho ari vyo wahisemwo kurusha imibabaro.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Imana ishizwe hejuru mu bubasha bwayo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Ni nde yoba umwigisha kuyisumvya?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Ni nde yoyibwira ico ikora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">canke ni nde yoyibwira ati: ‘Wakoze nabi?’<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Ahubwo nushime ibikorwa vyayo vyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">ivyo abantu bose bashimagiza mu ndirimbo.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Abaremwe bose barabibonye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">abantu bose babirabira kure.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Raba Imana irahambaye, natwe ntidushobora kuyitahura!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Imyaka yayo ntigira igitigiri.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Yegeranya utuma tw’amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">hanyuma ikaduhindura imvura.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Ibicu bisesa imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">isinzi ry’abantu rigashikirwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Ni nde yotahura ingene ikwiragiza hose ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">n’uguturagara kwo kw’ijuru?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Raba ingene ikwiragiza imiravyo impande zayo zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">igapfuka i bwina h’ikiyaga.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Uko ni kwo iganje amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">ikayaha ivyokurya vy’umusesekara.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Ifata umuravyo mu ntoke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ikawutumbereza ku co yawugeneye.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Umuturagaro umenyekanisha ko ari ho iri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">n’ibitungwa bikamenya ko yegereje.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Kubera ivyo umutima wanje uradidagizwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ugahakwa kuncamwo.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Nimwumvirize namwe, mwumve ijwi ry’ukwivuga kwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">mwumve ugukankama kw’akanwa kayo.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Irekurira imiravyo yayo musi y’ijuru hose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">ikaravya gushitsa ku mpera z’isi zose.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Inyuma y’ivyo haza ijwi ry’ukwivuga kwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">igaturagarisha ijwi ryayo ry’icubahiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Iyo ijwi ryayo risamiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">nta co yisigariza.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Imana ituragara mu buryo butangaje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">igakora ibihambaye birengeye ubwenge bwacu.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Ibarira shelegi iti: ‘Gwa kw’isi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">imvura ikayibwira ati: ‘Segenyukira kw’isi.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Iboha amaboko y’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">kugira ngo babone ibikorwa vy’amaboko yayo.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Ibikoko birihisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">bikanyegera mu myobo.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Ibihuhusi bituruka mu bumanuko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">imbeho ikava ku muyaga wo mu buraruko.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Impwemu z’Imana zizana urubura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">amazi y’ikidengeri agakomera nk’icuma.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Ibicu ivyuzuza ikime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ikabisanzaza birabagiza imiravyo.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Ikabizungurutsa impande zose uko ibishatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">bigakora ico ishatse ko bikora kw’isi cose.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Ni yo izana ibicu nk’igihano kuri bamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">ku bandi bikababera umugisha.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Tega amatwi ibi, yewe Yobu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">Hagarara wumvirize, utahure ibitangaza vy’Imana!<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Mbega urazi ingene Imana igenzura ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">igatuma n’imiravyo yo ku bicu vyayo irasa?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Mbega urazi ingene ibicu biterwa inkingi bigahagarara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">Urazi ivyo bikorwa bitangaje vy’ubwenge bwayo butunganye?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Urazi igituma impuzu zawe zisusuruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">iyo hatekereje kubera umuyaga wo mu bumanuko?<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Mbega hari ico woyifasha iyo iriko iragaranzura ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">kandi rikomeye nk’icirore gikozwe mu butare bw’umwakaka?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Tubwire ico twoyibarira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">kuko umwijima utubuza kugira amajambo atumbereye.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Mbega hari uworinda kuyibwira ko afise ico agomba kuyibwira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Hari uwokwipfuza kumirwa miyonzwa?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Nta woshobora guhanga amaso izuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">n’ukuntu kw’ijuru haba hakayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">iyo umuyaga waheyuye.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Mu buraruko haturuka ubwiza bukayangana nk’inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Imana ikaza yambaye ubwiza butangaje.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Iyishoboravyose iri aho tutoshika, ishizwe hejuru mu bushobozi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">Imanza zayo ziragororotse cane, ntiyigera iducinyiza.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Abantu bose barayubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">kuko ntiyigera ishira umutima ku bigira abanyabwenge.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we aravuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuganira na Yobu mu gihuhusi, ati:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Mbega uwo ni nde agira ubusa imigambi yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">mu majambo yiwe atagiramwo ubwenge?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Kenyera magabo rero uze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">kuko mfise ivyo ngomba kukubaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">nawe uheze unyishure.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Mbega wari hehe igihe nashiraho imfatiro z’isi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Nyishura nimba ufise ico ubitahurako.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Ni nde yayitambutse amatambwe, nimba ubizi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Ni nde yayipimishije umugozi?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Ibinogo vy’inkingi zayo vyimbwe mu ki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Ni nde yayishiriyeho amabuye y’imfuruka,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />igihe inyenyeri zo mu gaturuturu zaririmbira hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">abana b’Imana na bo bagatera impundu?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Ni nde yashingiye akarimbi ikiyaga igihe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">cari gisendanishije nk’ikivuye mu nda,<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />nkacambika ibicu nk’umutamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">nkagitwikira umwijima w’umuzitanya,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />igihe nagishingira uburimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">nkagishiriraho imiryango n’ivyugazo,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />nkavuga nti: ‘Aha ni ho uzogarukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">imipfunda yawe yiterera hejuru ntizorenge aha’?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Mbega warigeze utegeka umusi kubaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">canke ngo wereke umutwenzi aho utamanzurira?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Warigeze utegeka umuco ngo ukwire impera z’isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">kugira ngo wirukane ibikorwa bibi vyo mu mwijima?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Umuco iyo uje, isi igira imero kurya kw’ibumba rigiyeko ikidodo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">kurya kw’impuzu ishizweko ibisharizo.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Inkozi z’ibibi bazimye umuco zikeneye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">ukuboko kwazo kudugijwe hejuru kuravunaguwe.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Mbega uragendagenda ugashika kw’isoko ry’ikiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">canke uratembera ngo ushike i bwina haco?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Mbega urerekwa amarembo y’urupfu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Urabona amarembo y’igitutu c’urupfu?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Mbega uratahura ubunini bw’isi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Nyishura niwaba ubizi.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Nyereka inzira ija iwabo w’umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">n’aho umwijima uba.<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Mbega wobiherekeza ukabishikana aho biba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Urazi inzira ija ku mihana yavyo?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Ariko ndazi urabizi kuko wavutse bitararemwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">kandi ukaba uri inararibonye!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Mbega uramaze kwinjira mu bubiko bwa shelegi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">canke uramaze kubona ububiko bw’urubura,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ivyo naziganirije imisi y’ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ari yo misi y’intambara n’ingwano?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Mbega umuravyo uravya uvuye hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Canke umuyaga wo mu buseruko ukwira kw’isi uvuye hehe?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Ni nde yaciriye isegenya imigende ishungurukamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">agacira inzira umuravyo?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Ni nde agwisha imvura kw’isi itamera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">no mu bugaragwa butagiramwo abantu?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Ni nde arungika imvura ngo inyweshe isi igadutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">kugira ngo imere ibiterwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Mbega imvura irafise se yayivyaye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Ni nde yavyaye ikime?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Urubura rwavuye mu nda ya nde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">N’ibicu bikanye cane vyavyawe na nde?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Iyo igikonyozi kije, amazi ahinduka nk’ibuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">hejuru ku mazi y’ikiyaga hakagumarara.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Mbega wofata inyenyeri ukazibuza kugendagenda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Canke ukabohora imigozi y’inyenyeri zitwa Oriyoni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Woshobora gutuma ibihe bigenda bikuranwa n’ibindi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Ukarongora idubu n’ivyana vyaryo?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Mbega urazi amategeko agenga ijuru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Mbega ni wewe ugerera Imana ubutware kw’isi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Mbega woshobora gukankamira ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">kugira ngo bigusukeko isegenya y’imvura?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Ni wewe urungika imituragaro mu nzira zayo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Mbega iraza ikakwiyereka ikakubwira iti: ‘Ehe twaje’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Mbega ni nde ashira ubwenge mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">imitwe akayiha ugutahura?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Ni nde afise ubwenge bwomushoboza guharura ibicu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Ni nde yohengeka imibindi y’amazi yo mw’ijuru,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />iyo isi yakomantaye nk’igitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ibinonko bikibumba?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Mbega ni wewe uhigira intambwe ico irya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">canke ni wewe uhaza inzara y’intare?<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />Iyo zibunze mu vyobo vyazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">canke iyo zitegurira gutera mw’ishamba?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Iyo ibikona bishonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">bikansemerera kugira ngo ndabigaburire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">ni wewe ubihaza?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Mbega urazi igihe ingeregere zivyarirako imyagazi yazo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Uramaze kubona impongo ziriko ziravyara?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Urazi amezi zimara zihaka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Igihe co kuvyara cazo kigeze urabimenya?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Zirapfukama zikavyara imyagazi yazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">imibabaro yazo ikaba iraheze.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Imyagazi yazo ikurira mu gahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">hanyuma igatandukana na ba nyina ubutakigaruka.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Ni nde atuma indogoba iba inyeshamba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Ni nde abohora imigozi iba iyiboshe?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Ni jewe ndayishira mu gahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">inzu zayo zikaba mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Yanka urwamo rwo mu gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">ntiyumva induru z’abatwara imikogote.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Mu mitumba ni ho irisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ni ho itembera irondera icanya gitotahaye.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Mbega inka y’inyeshamba woyigisha inama kugira ngo igukorere?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Yokwemera kurara mu bwato bwawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Mbega woyishirako ingogo ngo irime?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Yogukurikira igenda irakangaza mu ndimiro zawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Mbega wokwizigira inkomezi zayo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Mbega woyizeza ibikorwa vyawe ukaraba iyo wigira?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Mbega woyizeza kugutahanira ingano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">ikazegeraniriza ku mbuga yawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Inyoni yitwa otirishe igorora amababa yayo n’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">ariko ntiyogereranywa n’amababa n’amoya vy’agasoza.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Ita amagi yayo kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">akaronkera agasusuruko mu mukungugu,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Ntiyigera ihagarika umutima ngo ibirenge bizoyamena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">canke ngo ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba bizoyahonyanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Ikarira imiswi yayo nk’aho atari iyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">naho yoruhira ubusa, nta co biyitwara,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />kuko Imana itayihaye ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">canke ngo iyihe ugutahura.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Ariko iyo igoroye amababa yayo yiruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">yenurira ifarasi n’uwuyigenderako.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Mbega ni wewe uha inkomezi ifarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">izosi ryayo ukaryambika?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Ni wewe uyitarukisha nk’igihori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">mu gupfuha n’ubwishime vyayo?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Ihonyangisha isi ibinono vyayo n’inkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">ikiterera imbere y’umwansi<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Isuzugura ubwoba, nta co itinya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">Ntihunga inkota.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Ibigwanisho vyose biyihurirako:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">ryaba icumu canke umwampi.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Isimbana inkomezi, ikamara imirambi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">Ijwi ry’inzamba ntiriyihagarika.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Iyo inzamba ivuze, irabira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">Imoterwa n’urugamba ikiri kure.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">Yumva akamo k’intwazangabo n’akaruru k’intambara.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Mbega ubwenge bwawe ni bwo bugurukana agaca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">kagasanza amababa kaja mu bumanuko?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Mbega ni wewe uha itegeko inkona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">ngo ziduge hejuru cane ku misozi kwarikayo?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Yibera ku bitandara, ikararaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">ibisate vy’amabuye bikayibera ibikingirizo.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Aho ni ho irerekera ico ifata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">amaso yayo akakibona ari kure.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Ibiswi vyayo binywa amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">kuko aho hose umuvyimba uri ni ho iba iri.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yobu ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Mbega umunyabihari yoharira n’Iyishoboravyose?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Uwuhaririza Imana niyishure!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Maze Yobu aca yishura <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Mbega jewe umuntu ata co maze, nokwishura iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Nshize ikiganza ku munwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Naravuze ayakwiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">ubu nta co mfise mvuga.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuganira na Yobu mu gihuhusi, ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Hagarara wemye nk’umugabo w’umuhizi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ngiye kukubaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">maze nawe unyishure.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Ugomba guhindura ubusa imanza zanje?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Ugomba kunyegekako amakosa kugira ngo wiyerekane ko ugororotse?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Mbega unganya ukuboko n’Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Ijwi ryawe ryoturagara nk’iryayo?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Niwisakare ubwiza n’ubukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">wambare icubahiro n’igitinyiro.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Rekura ukuraka kw’ubushangashirwe bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">wihweze abibona bose ubacishe bugufi.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Ihweze uwishize hejuru wese umucishe bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">inkozi y’ikibi uyifyonyorere aho ihagaze.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Bahambe mw’ivu bose hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">Amaso yabo uyapfukirire i kuzimu.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Ni ho nanje nzokwemera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ko ukuboko kwawe kwoshobora kugukiza.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Niwitegereze imvubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">iyo naremye nk’uko nakuremye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">Irisha ubwatsi nk’inka.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Inkomezi zayo ziri mu mafyigo yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">n’ububasha bwayo buri mu mitsi yo mu nda.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Umurizo wayo udadaraye nk’isederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">imitsi yo ku matako yayo irasobanganye nk’ikijishano gikomeye.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Amagufa yayo ameze nk’imiringoti y’umwakaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">amaguru n’amaboko yayo akomeye nk’inkoni z’ivyuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Mu vyaremwe n’Imana vyose, ni ica mbere gitangaje cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">umuremyi wayo wenyene ni we yoyitera ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Imisozi iyimereza ivyokurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">aho ibindi bikoko vyo mw’ishamba vyose bikinira.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Iryama musi y’ibiti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">yihishije mu marenga yo mu nzuzi.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Ibiti biyiha igitutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">ibimera ku nkengera z’amazi bikayikikuza.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Iyo uruzi rusuriranye ntihagarika umutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">naho Yorodani rwosesera mu munwa wayo ntiyotinya.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Mbega hari uwoyifata ikanura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">canke hari uwoyita mu mutego ngo ayitobore izuru?”<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Mbega woshobora kurobesha Leviyatani igera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">canke ururimi rwayo worubohesha umugozi?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Mbega woyibohesha umugozi uwucishije mu zuru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">Umubangabanga wayo wowutoboza uruhindu?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Mbega yokwinginga ngo uyigirire impuhwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">ikabigusaba mu majambo yiyoroheje?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Mbega mwogiranira isezerano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ikemera kukubera umugurano imisi yo kubaho kwayo yose?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Mbega woyigira igitungwa co gukinisha nk’uko bakinisha inyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">canke woyizirika kugira ngo unezereze abakobwa bawe?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Mbega abadandaza boyirangura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">bakayigurisha ku bandi badandaza?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Mbega urusato rwayo rwotoborwa n’imyampi yawe y’ingobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">canke umutwe wayo wotobozwa icumu ryica amafi?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Uyishoreyeko ukuboko, intambara wogira ntiwoyibagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">kandi ntiwokwigera usubira.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Ivyiyumviro vyose vyo kuyifata ni ivy’ubusa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">Kuyikubita ijisho vyonyene bitera igihumura.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Nta n’umwe yubahuka kuyikomakoma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">None ni nde yoshobora kumpangara?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Ni nde mfitiye umwenda ngo ndamwishure?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Ibiri musi y’ijuru vyose ni ivyanje.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Sinoreka kuvuga ingingo za Leviyatani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">inkomezi zayo hamwe n’ubwiza bw’umutumba wayo.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Ni nde yoyambura umwambaro wayo wo hejuru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Ni nde yokwishira hagati mu majigo yayo?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Ni nde yokwubahuka kwugurura umuryango w’akanwa kayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">ko mu menyo hayo hateye ubwoba?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Umugongo wayo utonzeko inkinzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">kandi ziramatanye zomekeranije rwose,<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />imwe yose imatanye n’iyindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">nta n’akayaga gaca hagati yazo.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Zirafatanije kandi ziragumye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">zomanyeko ntizishobora kumadukanako.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Kwasamura kwayo kuvamwo umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">amaso yayo ameze nk’imishwarara yo mu bucagucagu.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Umuriro uva mu kanwa kayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">amasase agataruka awuvamwo.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Umwotsi upfunduka uva mu mazuru yayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">nk’uw’inkono ibiragira canke uw’amahwa ariko arasha.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Uguhumeka kwayo kwatsa amakara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">imbeya zikava mu kanwa kayo.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Inkomezi ziri kw’izosi ryayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">iterabwoba rigendera imbere yayo.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Ibigize umubiri wayo birafatanije cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">ntibinyiganyizwa na gato.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Umutima wayo ukomeye nk’ibuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">ukomeye nk’urusyo.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Iyo ihagurutse, abahizi barajugumira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">bagata umutwe kubera ubwoba.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Inkota iyishikiriye nta co iyigira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">canke icumu, canke umwampi w’amashami, canke ikimito.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Ivyuma kuri yo ni nk’ivyatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">umwakaka na wo umeze nk’igiti kibunzwe.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Imyampi nticirukana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">ibuye ritewe n’umugozi rimeze nk’umuguruka kuri yo.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Ibihiri ibigereranya n’ivyatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">isuzugura umuhunda w’icumu.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Inda yayo ifutswe n’ibimeze nk’injo zikarishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">zisiga imirongo mu vyondo aho yakweze inda.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Isuragura mw’ibenga hakaba nk’inkono ibiragira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">ikiyaga ikagihindura nk’ikarabo ry’amavuta yo kwisiga<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Aho iciye ihasiga inzira ikayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">ni nk’aho mw’ibenga hasheshe imvi.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Kw’isi nta na kimwe kingana na yo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">ni ikiremwa kidatinya ikintu na kimwe.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Kirabana agakengerwe ivyishira hejuru vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">ni co mwami w’ivyirata vyose.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Maze Yobu yishura <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Ndazi ko ushobora vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">kandi ko ata co wiyumviriye gukora kitaja mu ngiro.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Urabaza uti: ‘Uwo ni nde, mu bujuju bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">agomba kuzimanganya imigambi yanje?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ni ukuri navuze ivyo ntatahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ibitangaza birengeye uko nomenya.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Wambwiye uti: ‘Tega amatwi, ngira mvuge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ndakubaze, nawe unyishure.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Amatwi yanje yari yarakwumvise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">none amaso yanje arakwiboneye.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />None rero ndigaye ivyo navuze vyose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">Ndihanye nicaye mu mukungugu no mu munyota.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyakurikiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaze kubwira Yobu ayo majambo, aca abwira Elifazi Umunyatemani ati: “Ndabarakiye mwe na bagenzi banyu, ko mutamvuzeko ibigororotse, nk’uko umusavyi wanje Yobu yabimvuzeko. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />None rero nimufate amapfizi indwi y’inka n’amapfizi indwi y’intama, muje imbere y’umusavyi wanje Yobu, mwitangire ibimazi mwebwe nyene. Umusavyi wanje Yobu azobasengera, maze nanje nzokwumva amasengesho yiwe, ndeke kubahana ibikwiranye n’ubujuju bwanyu. Ntiwamvuzeko ibigororotse nk’uko umusavyi wanje Yobu yabimvuzeko.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Nuko Elifazi Umunyatemani, ari kumwe na Biludadi Umunyeshuhi, na Zofari Umunyenayamati, bakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwiye, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we yemera isengesho rya Yobu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Yobu amaze gusengera bagenziwe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asubira kumuha ubutunzi buruta incuro zibiri ubwo yari afise ubwa mbere. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Abo bavukana bose, hamwe n’abo bari bazinanyi kuva kera, baraza basangira na we i muhira iwe. Baramwirura ku bw’amagorwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamuteye, kandi umwumwe wese amugabira ifeza n’impeta z’inzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahezagira ubuzima bwa Yobu bwakurikiye gusumba ubwa mbere. Aronka intama ibihumbi cumi na bine, ingamiya ibihumbi bitandatu, inka zirima igihumbi, hamwe n’indogoba igihumbi, <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />yongera aronka abahungu indwi n’abakobwa batatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Umukobwa wa mbere yamwise Yemima, uwa kabiri amwita Keziya, uwa gatatu na we amwita Kereni-Hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Muri ico gihugu cabo, nta bandi bakobwa bariho banganya ubwiza n’abakobwa ba Yobu, kandi sewabo yabahaye gutorana hamwe n’abahungu biwe.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yobu yabayeho iyindi myaka ijana na mirongo ine, abona abuzukuru n’abuzukuruza gushika kuri iconiki. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Nuko Yobu apfa ashaje cane, ageze mu zabukuru.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>